  ('176 Tooth - 1/2in Width - RT25 Belt', 'REV-21-4176', 'RT25 Belts are toothed belts with a 1/4in pitch are compatible with the REV ION System. These belts are comparable in strength to the belts that teams are used to using while working on the pitch of the ION build system. Belts are lighter than chain and can operate at higher speeds. RT25 provides the strength and torque capacity for mechanisms like drivetrains, intakes, and shooters. Features On pitch with the ION Build System Specifications Material: Body: Neoprene Cords: Fiberglass Pitch:…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/RT25-Belts-1/2in-Width/?sku=REV-21-4176', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/698/images/2669/4120-edit__69834.1650404239.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('184 Tooth - 1/2in Width - RT25 Belt', 'REV-21-4184', 'RT25 Belts are toothed belts with a 1/4in pitch are compatible with the REV ION System. These belts are comparable in strength to the belts that teams are used to using while working on the pitch of the ION build system. Belts are lighter than chain and can operate at higher speeds. RT25 provides the strength and torque capacity for mechanisms like drivetrains, intakes, and shooters. Features On pitch with the ION Build System Specifications Material: Body: Neoprene Cords: Fiberglass Pitch:…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/RT25-Belts-1/2in-Width/?sku=REV-21-4184', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/698/images/2669/4120-edit__69834.1650404239.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('192 Tooth - 1/2in Width - RT25 Belt', 'REV-21-4192', 'RT25 Belts are toothed belts with a 1/4in pitch are compatible with the REV ION System. These belts are comparable in strength to the belts that teams are used to using while working on the pitch of the ION build system. Belts are lighter than chain and can operate at higher speeds. RT25 provides the strength and torque capacity for mechanisms like drivetrains, intakes, and shooters. Features On pitch with the ION Build System Specifications Material: Body: Neoprene Cords: Fiberglass Pitch:…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/RT25-Belts-1/2in-Width/?sku=REV-21-4192', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/698/images/2669/4120-edit__69834.1650404239.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('200 Tooth - 1/2in Width - RT25 Belt', 'REV-21-4200', 'RT25 Belts are toothed belts with a 1/4in pitch are compatible with the REV ION System. These belts are comparable in strength to the belts that teams are used to using while working on the pitch of the ION build system. Belts are lighter than chain and can operate at higher speeds. RT25 provides the strength and torque capacity for mechanisms like drivetrains, intakes, and shooters. Features On pitch with the ION Build System Specifications Material: Body: Neoprene Cords: Fiberglass Pitch:…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/RT25-Belts-1/2in-Width/?sku=REV-21-4200', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/698/images/2669/4120-edit__69834.1650404239.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('208 Tooth - 1/2in Width - RT25 Belt', 'REV-21-4208', 'RT25 Belts are toothed belts with a 1/4in pitch are compatible with the REV ION System. These belts are comparable in strength to the belts that teams are used to using while working on the pitch of the ION build system. Belts are lighter than chain and can operate at higher speeds. RT25 provides the strength and torque capacity for mechanisms like drivetrains, intakes, and shooters. Features On pitch with the ION Build System Specifications Material: Body: Neoprene Cords: Fiberglass Pitch:…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/RT25-Belts-1/2in-Width/?sku=REV-21-4208', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/698/images/2669/4120-edit__69834.1650404239.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('216 Tooth - 1/2in Width - RT25 Belt', 'REV-21-4216', 'RT25 Belts are toothed belts with a 1/4in pitch are compatible with the REV ION System. These belts are comparable in strength to the belts that teams are used to using while working on the pitch of the ION build system. Belts are lighter than chain and can operate at higher speeds. RT25 provides the strength and torque capacity for mechanisms like drivetrains, intakes, and shooters. Features On pitch with the ION Build System Specifications Material: Body: Neoprene Cords: Fiberglass Pitch:…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/RT25-Belts-1/2in-Width/?sku=REV-21-4216', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/698/images/2669/4120-edit__69834.1650404239.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('4in Spiky Wheel - Aluminum Hub', 'REV-21-4418', 'The 4in Spiky Wheel Aluminum Hub is a precision machined and balanced wheel hub designed for use with the 4in Spiky Wheel system and the 4in EasySwerve Module. Built from 6061 aluminum, this hub provides a strong and reliable foundation for high-traction spiky treads. Its wide profile, optimized mounting pattern, and MAXSpline bore make it a durable and high-performance solution for competitive robots. Integrated counterbores around the tread mounting holes make screw installation easier and…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-4418/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/929/images/3714/REV-21-4418_4inSpikyWheel_Hero_EDITED_1__89526.1765303542.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / New Products', 'rev'),
  ('4in Spiky Wheel - Tread - 8 Pack', 'REV-21-4419-PK8', 'The 4in Spiky Wheel Tread 8 Pack provides replacement treads for teams using the 4in Spiky Wheels on their EasySwerve -equipped robots. These injection molded TPU treads feature an aggressive spiked geometry designed to maximize traction on FRC carpet without causing excessive wear or damaging field surfaces. Each tread includes a slight curvature along its length to ensure a reliable wrap around the 4in aluminum hub. With eight (8) treads included, teams receive two full replacement sets for…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-4419-pk8/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/930/images/3719/REV-21-4419_HERO_FINAL_1__78617.1765311318.500.500.jpg?c=2', 'Shop All', 'rev'),
  ('MAXPlanetary Kraken X44 & Minion Adapter Plate', 'REV-21-4444', 'These ION Motor Brackets are compatible with the REV ION System. The ION UltraPlanetary Face Mount Bracket (REV-21-2046) allows for easy mounting of our UltraPlanetary Gearbox to any of our MAXTube products. Each plate features 2x #10-32 tapped inserts for straightforward mounting on any structure. The MAXSpline Bracket - Motor Mount - Flat (REV-21-2360) facilitates quick mounting of motors or gearboxes with a 2in bolt pattern to MAXTubing or structures. It includes a MAXSpline Bore for…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-Motor-Brackets/?sku=REV-21-4444', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/868/images/3454/ION_Motor_Brackets-Family-Hero-FINAL__60886.1734558475.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Structure', 'rev'),
  ('8mm Shaft Spacer - 1/16in - Plain - 50 Pack', 'REV-21-4483-PK50', 'The 8mm Shaft Spacer is a stainless steel 1/16 inch washer designed for precise shaft spacing in FRC and FTC mechanisms. Used on the NEO 2.0 Brushless Motor to achieve correct input coupler alignment in MAXPlanetary assemblies, this spacer also fits any 8mm shafting, including 15T Spline Shafts. Its consistent thickness and small size make it ideal for fine adjustment, shimming, and maintaining proper component clearance. Features Compatible with 8mm shafts including 15T Spline Shafts Provides…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-4483-pk50/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/938/images/3718/REV-21-4483-PK50_HERO_FINAL__25966.1765308555.500.500.jpg?c=2', 'Competition / New Products', 'rev'),
  ('15T Spline to 1/2in Hex Adapter', 'REV-21-4484', 'The 15T Spline to 1/2in Hex Adapter provides a simple and reliable way to integrate motors with a 15T spline output shaft into mechanisms designed around 1/2in rounded hex. This adapter is ideal for teams looking to pair the NEO 2.0 Brushless Motor (REV-21-1653) with common FRC drivetrain and mechanism components. By converting 15T Spline to 0.5in rounded hex, this adapter opens the door to a wide range of compatible hardware including wheels, sprockets, gears, pulleys, and custom assemblies.…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-4484/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/925/images/3626/REV-21-4484_HERO_FINAL__96983.1763747233.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / New Products / New FRC Products', 'rev'),
  ('RT25 Aluminum Pulley - 15T Spline - 1/2in Width - 12 Tooth', 'REV-21-4485', 'RT25 pulleys pair with RT25 belts to create a power transmission system that matches the exact pitch of #25 chain while aligning with the 1/2in ION Build System pitch. This makes RT25 a drop in alternative to #25 chain and sprockets with the advantages of a belt driven system. RT25 provides the strength and torque capacity needed for drivetrains, intakes, shooters, and other high demand mechanisms while offering lower weight and higher speed capability than chain. Features On pitch with the…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/RT25-Pulleys/?sku=REV-21-4485', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/699/images/3306/REV-21-2200-RT25Pulleys-FamilyHero-May2024-FINAL__59764.1716584345.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('MAXSpline Shaft - Polycarbonate - 47in', 'REV-21-6520', 'The MAXSpline Shaft - (REV-21-2520) is compatible with the REV ION System. The shaft is an extruded aluminum MAXSpline that provides a high strength alternative to 1/2in hex shaft that can interface with any REV ION System components with a MAXSpline bore. The inner diameter is 1in and can fit a Needle Bearing for dead axle applications. The MAXSpline Shaft -Polycarbonate (REV-21-6520) brings the versatility of the MAXSpline profile to lightweight mechanisms where reducing mass is a priority.…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXSpline-shafts-47in?sku=REV-21-6520', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/932/images/3880/REV-21-2520-6520_MAXSplineShaft_Family_FINAL__35446.1791303305.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / New Products', 'rev'),
  ('Locking Shaft Collar - MAXSpline - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-6532-PK2', 'The Locking Shaft Collar MAXSpline is a compact, purpose built clamping solution for securing components to a MAXSpline shaft. Designed as a thin aluminum plate, it can be paired with a second collar or mounted directly to any MAXSpline wheel or sprocket that features standard nut pocket slots. The collar uses an internal wedge mechanism that engages as the assembly is tightened. As the collar is drawn toward its mating plate or wheel, the wedges cause a counter twisting action between it and…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-6532-pk2/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/945/images/3640/REV-21-6532_H_FINAL__17805.1764881379.500.500.JPG?c=2', 'Shop All', 'rev'),
  ('ION Conveyor Brush System — Conveyor Brush - 24in', 'REV-21-6534', 'The ION Conveyor Brush System is a customizable solution for creating wide to narrow intake brushes that adapt to a variety of game pieces. The 24in brush can be cut to any length using a bandsaw or hacksaw, allowing teams to fine tune coverage and stiffness for their intake or conveyor design. The nylon bristles are firm enough to control and center objects, yet flexible enough to accommodate irregular shapes or soft materials. Shortening the brush increases bristle stiffness, giving teams a…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ion-conveyor-brush-system?sku=REV-21-6534', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/940/images/3695/ConveyorBrushSystem_FAMILYFINAL__25930.1764996098.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / New Products / New FRC Products', 'rev'),
  ('Hub Adapter - MAXSpline to 1/2in Hex - 1/2in - 4 Pack', 'REV-21-6535-PK4', 'The REV Hub Adapter MAXSpline to 1/2in Hex makes it fast and easy to convert MAXSpline based wheels, sprockets, and other ION components to a standard 1/2in hex drive interface. Designed for flexibility and ease of use, these split adapters press directly into a MAXSpline bore and instantly change the torque transfer interface without additional hardware. Each adapter is made from durable glass filled nylon and features a split design that lightly snaps into place when inserted into a…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-Hub-Adapters?sku=REV-21-6535-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/951/images/3769/REV-21-6535-37_HUBAdapter_Family_FINAL__50421.1774462876.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Motion / Wheels', 'rev'),
  ('Hub Adapter - MAXSpline to 1/2in Hex - 1in - 4 Pack', 'REV-21-6536-PK4', 'The REV Hub Adapter MAXSpline to 1/2in Hex makes it fast and easy to convert MAXSpline based wheels, sprockets, and other ION components to a standard 1/2in hex drive interface. Designed for flexibility and ease of use, these split adapters press directly into a MAXSpline bore and instantly change the torque transfer interface without additional hardware. Each adapter is made from durable glass filled nylon and features a split design that lightly snaps into place when inserted into a…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-Hub-Adapters?sku=REV-21-6536-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/951/images/3769/REV-21-6535-37_HUBAdapter_Family_FINAL__50421.1774462876.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Motion / Wheels', 'rev'),
  ('Hub Adapter - MAXSpline to 1/2in Hex - 1-1/2in - 4 Pack', 'REV-21-6537-PK4', 'The REV Hub Adapter MAXSpline to 1/2in Hex makes it fast and easy to convert MAXSpline based wheels, sprockets, and other ION components to a standard 1/2in hex drive interface. Designed for flexibility and ease of use, these split adapters press directly into a MAXSpline bore and instantly change the torque transfer interface without additional hardware. Each adapter is made from durable glass filled nylon and features a split design that lightly snaps into place when inserted into a…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-Hub-Adapters?sku=REV-21-6537-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/951/images/3769/REV-21-6535-37_HUBAdapter_Family_FINAL__50421.1774462876.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Motion / Wheels', 'rev'),
  ('Cone Wheel - 2in to 3in - MAXSpline - Hard', 'REV-21-6550', 'ION Cone Wheels are designed to give teams controlled, predictable vectoring for game pieces and objects. Their tapered profile naturally guides items toward the smaller diameter, making them especially effective in intake edge zones and in-feed mechanisms where centering or directional control is critical. Whether used to straighten, funnel, or shift objects laterally, Cone Wheels provide a consistent way to manipulate game pieces without complex mechanical assemblies. These wheels are sized…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-cone-wheels?sku=REV-21-6550', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/933/images/3645/REV-21-6563-64-50_ConeWheel-2to3in_FAMILY-FINAL__83662.1764891648.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All', 'rev'),
  ('Cone Wheel - 3in to 4in - MAXSpline - Hard', 'REV-21-6551', 'ION Cone Wheels are designed to give teams controlled, predictable vectoring for game pieces and objects. Their tapered profile naturally guides items toward the smaller diameter, making them especially effective in intake edge zones and in-feed mechanisms where centering or directional control is critical. Whether used to straighten, funnel, or shift objects laterally, Cone Wheels provide a consistent way to manipulate game pieces without complex mechanical assemblies. These wheels are sized…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-cone-wheels?sku=REV-21-6551', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/933/images/3645/REV-21-6563-64-50_ConeWheel-2to3in_FAMILY-FINAL__83662.1764891648.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All', 'rev'),
  ('2in - MAXSpline - Medium - Complaint Wheel - 10 Pack', 'REV-21-6555-PK10', 'ION Compliant Wheels are compatible with the REV ION System and come in a wide range of sizes, durometers, and bores. Larger wheels contain the MAXSpline bore, but can be adapted to other bores with a separate MAXHub. The radial spoke profile allows for more consistent compliance, and more compression than other compliant wheels. Specifications Compliant Wheel - 2in - MAXSpline Bore: Hubless - Stretch-to-fit MAXSpline Material: Silicone Durometer: 30A (Medium - Dark Grey) Width: 11.1mm…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-Compliant-Wheels/?sku=REV-21-6555-PK10', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/664/images/2645/Untitled-6__21982.1650295805.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('6in - MAXSpline - 6F - Hard', 'REV-21-6559', 'ION Flap Wheels are designed for intakes and conveyance that need reliable performance when interacting with irregular or variable gamepieces. Similar to compliant wheels, they provide a flexible interface, but their flap-based design introduces intentional slip between the wheel and the gamepiece. This helps smooth out transitions, reduce jams, and improve handling consistency across a wide range of shapes and materials. Each wheel is built from a durable polypropylene core with flexible TPR…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ion-flap-wheels/?sku=REV-21-6559', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/805/images/3707/REV-21-6559-67-68_FlapWheel-FAMILY-FINAL__78500.1765235045.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Launcher', 'rev'),
  ('Conveyor Brush Hub - MAXSpline - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-6561-PK2', 'The ION Conveyor Brush System is a customizable solution for creating wide to narrow intake brushes that adapt to a variety of game pieces. The 24in brush can be cut to any length using a bandsaw or hacksaw, allowing teams to fine tune coverage and stiffness for their intake or conveyor design. The nylon bristles are firm enough to control and center objects, yet flexible enough to accommodate irregular shapes or soft materials. Shortening the brush increases bristle stiffness, giving teams a…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ion-conveyor-brush-system?sku=REV-21-6561-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/940/images/3695/ConveyorBrushSystem_FAMILYFINAL__25930.1764996098.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / New Products / New FRC Products', 'rev'),
  ('Conveyor Brush Hub - 1/2in Hex - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-6562-PK2', 'The ION Conveyor Brush System is a customizable solution for creating wide to narrow intake brushes that adapt to a variety of game pieces. The 24in brush can be cut to any length using a bandsaw or hacksaw, allowing teams to fine tune coverage and stiffness for their intake or conveyor design. The nylon bristles are firm enough to control and center objects, yet flexible enough to accommodate irregular shapes or soft materials. Shortening the brush increases bristle stiffness, giving teams a…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ion-conveyor-brush-system?sku=REV-21-6562-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/940/images/3695/ConveyorBrushSystem_FAMILYFINAL__25930.1764996098.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / New Products / New FRC Products', 'rev'),
  ('Cone Wheel - 2in to 3in - MAXSpline - Soft', 'REV-21-6563', 'ION Cone Wheels are designed to give teams controlled, predictable vectoring for game pieces and objects. Their tapered profile naturally guides items toward the smaller diameter, making them especially effective in intake edge zones and in-feed mechanisms where centering or directional control is critical. Whether used to straighten, funnel, or shift objects laterally, Cone Wheels provide a consistent way to manipulate game pieces without complex mechanical assemblies. These wheels are sized…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-cone-wheels?sku=REV-21-6563', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/933/images/3645/REV-21-6563-64-50_ConeWheel-2to3in_FAMILY-FINAL__83662.1764891648.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All', 'rev'),
  ('Cone Wheel - 2in to 3in - MAXSpline - Medium', 'REV-21-6564', 'ION Cone Wheels are designed to give teams controlled, predictable vectoring for game pieces and objects. Their tapered profile naturally guides items toward the smaller diameter, making them especially effective in intake edge zones and in-feed mechanisms where centering or directional control is critical. Whether used to straighten, funnel, or shift objects laterally, Cone Wheels provide a consistent way to manipulate game pieces without complex mechanical assemblies. These wheels are sized…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-cone-wheels?sku=REV-21-6564', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/933/images/3645/REV-21-6563-64-50_ConeWheel-2to3in_FAMILY-FINAL__83662.1764891648.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All', 'rev'),
  ('Cone Wheel - 3in to 4in - MAXSpline - Soft', 'REV-21-6565', 'ION Cone Wheels are designed to give teams controlled, predictable vectoring for game pieces and objects. Their tapered profile naturally guides items toward the smaller diameter, making them especially effective in intake edge zones and in-feed mechanisms where centering or directional control is critical. Whether used to straighten, funnel, or shift objects laterally, Cone Wheels provide a consistent way to manipulate game pieces without complex mechanical assemblies. These wheels are sized…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-cone-wheels?sku=REV-21-6565', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/933/images/3645/REV-21-6563-64-50_ConeWheel-2to3in_FAMILY-FINAL__83662.1764891648.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All', 'rev'),
  ('Cone Wheel - 3in to 4in - MAXSpline - Medium', 'REV-21-6566', 'ION Cone Wheels are designed to give teams controlled, predictable vectoring for game pieces and objects. Their tapered profile naturally guides items toward the smaller diameter, making them especially effective in intake edge zones and in-feed mechanisms where centering or directional control is critical. Whether used to straighten, funnel, or shift objects laterally, Cone Wheels provide a consistent way to manipulate game pieces without complex mechanical assemblies. These wheels are sized…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-cone-wheels?sku=REV-21-6566', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/933/images/3645/REV-21-6563-64-50_ConeWheel-2to3in_FAMILY-FINAL__83662.1764891648.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All', 'rev'),
  ('6in - MAXSpline - 6F - Soft', 'REV-21-6567', 'ION Flap Wheels are designed for intakes and conveyance that need reliable performance when interacting with irregular or variable gamepieces. Similar to compliant wheels, they provide a flexible interface, but their flap-based design introduces intentional slip between the wheel and the gamepiece. This helps smooth out transitions, reduce jams, and improve handling consistency across a wide range of shapes and materials. Each wheel is built from a durable polypropylene core with flexible TPR…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ion-flap-wheels/?sku=REV-21-6567', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/805/images/3707/REV-21-6559-67-68_FlapWheel-FAMILY-FINAL__78500.1765235045.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Launcher', 'rev'),
  ('6in - MAXSpline - 6F - Medium', 'REV-21-6568', 'ION Flap Wheels are designed for intakes and conveyance that need reliable performance when interacting with irregular or variable gamepieces. Similar to compliant wheels, they provide a flexible interface, but their flap-based design introduces intentional slip between the wheel and the gamepiece. This helps smooth out transitions, reduce jams, and improve handling consistency across a wide range of shapes and materials. Each wheel is built from a durable polypropylene core with flexible TPR…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ion-flap-wheels/?sku=REV-21-6568', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/805/images/3707/REV-21-6559-67-68_FlapWheel-FAMILY-FINAL__78500.1765235045.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Launcher', 'rev'),
  ('Vortex Shaft - 20DP Gear - 7T', 'REV-21-6800', 'The Vortex Shaft - 20DP Gear - 7T is compatible with the REV ION System and offers users the unique ability to achieve substantial gear reductions directly from the motor. This gear features a 7T 20DP design that is typically too small for an 8mm keyed input. However, it becomes possible when integrated into the motor shaft. The Vortex Shaft - 20DP Gear - 7T is addendum shifted to an 8T pitch diameter. This allows you to calculate center-to-center distances as if it were an 8T gear rather than…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-6800/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/811/images/3636/REV-21-6800_VortexShaft7T_FINAL__80466.1764193351.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Brushless / NEO Vortex & SPARK Flex', 'rev'),
  ('Vortex Shaft - 20DP Gear - 8T', 'REV-21-6801', 'The Vortex Shaft - 20DP Gear - 8T is compatible with the REV ION System and offers users the unique ability to achieve substantial gear reductions directly from the motor. This gear features a 8T 20DP design that is typically too small for an 8mm keyed input. However, it becomes possible when integrated into the motor shaft. Featuring a 1/2in hex section that drives the shaft and a built-in taper for effortless self-centering, much like a milling machine. When you secure the shaft using a…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-6801/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/935/images/3737/REV-21-6801_VortexShaft_Top_FINAL__82266.1767887479.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / New Products / New FRC Products', 'rev'),
  ('Through Bore Encoder Insert Pack', 'REV-25-1870', 'These are the same inserts that are included with the Through Bore Encoder. Specifications Weight(s): 3/8in Hex: 23.5g (0.051lbs) 5mm Hex: 24.0g (0.052lbs) 1/4in Round: 24.0g (0.052lbs) Kit Contents QTY 1 - 3/8in Hex to 1/2in Hex Insert (REV-21-1843) QTY 1 - 5mm Hex to 1/2in Hex Insert (REV-21-1844) QTY 1 - 1/4in Round to 1/2in Hex Insert (REV-21-1845) CAD & Drawings Through Bore Encoder (REV-11-1271) STEP File 3/8in Hex to 1/2in Hex Insert (REV-21-1843) STEP File 5mm Hex to 1/2in Hex Insert…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/REV-25-1870/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/540/images/1633/Through_Bore_Encoder_Both_Shots__18509.1596657473.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Sensors', 'rev'),
  ('RT25 Plastic Pulley Kit - MAXSpline - 24 Tooth', 'REV-25-2224', 'RT25 pulleys pair with RT25 belts to create a power transmission system that matches the exact pitch of #25 chain while aligning with the 1/2in ION Build System pitch. This makes RT25 a drop in alternative to #25 chain and sprockets with the advantages of a belt driven system. RT25 provides the strength and torque capacity needed for drivetrains, intakes, shooters, and other high demand mechanisms while offering lower weight and higher speed capability than chain. Features On pitch with the…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/RT25-Pulleys/?sku=REV-25-2224', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/699/images/3306/REV-21-2200-RT25Pulleys-FamilyHero-May2024-FINAL__59764.1716584345.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
