  ('RT25 Plastic Pulley Kit - MAXSpline - 40 Tooth', 'REV-25-2248', 'RT25 pulleys pair with RT25 belts to create a power transmission system that matches the exact pitch of #25 chain while aligning with the 1/2in ION Build System pitch. This makes RT25 a drop in alternative to #25 chain and sprockets with the advantages of a belt driven system. RT25 provides the strength and torque capacity needed for drivetrains, intakes, shooters, and other high demand mechanisms while offering lower weight and higher speed capability than chain. Features On pitch with the…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/RT25-Pulleys/?sku=REV-25-2248', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/699/images/3306/REV-21-2200-RT25Pulleys-FamilyHero-May2024-FINAL__59764.1716584345.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('RT25 Plastic Pulley Kit - MAXSpline - 48 Tooth', 'REV-25-2260', 'RT25 pulleys pair with RT25 belts to create a power transmission system that matches the exact pitch of #25 chain while aligning with the 1/2in ION Build System pitch. This makes RT25 a drop in alternative to #25 chain and sprockets with the advantages of a belt driven system. RT25 provides the strength and torque capacity needed for drivetrains, intakes, shooters, and other high demand mechanisms while offering lower weight and higher speed capability than chain. Features On pitch with the…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/RT25-Pulleys/?sku=REV-25-2260', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/699/images/3306/REV-21-2200-RT25Pulleys-FamilyHero-May2024-FINAL__59764.1716584345.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('RT25 Plastic Pulley Kit - MAXSpline - 56 Tooth', 'REV-25-2272', 'RT25 pulleys pair with RT25 belts to create a power transmission system that matches the exact pitch of #25 chain while aligning with the 1/2in ION Build System pitch. This makes RT25 a drop in alternative to #25 chain and sprockets with the advantages of a belt driven system. RT25 provides the strength and torque capacity needed for drivetrains, intakes, shooters, and other high demand mechanisms while offering lower weight and higher speed capability than chain. Features On pitch with the…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/RT25-Pulleys/?sku=REV-25-2272', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/699/images/3306/REV-21-2200-RT25Pulleys-FamilyHero-May2024-FINAL__59764.1716584345.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('RT25 Plastic Pulley Kit - MAXSpline - 64 Tooth', 'REV-25-2284', 'RT25 pulleys pair with RT25 belts to create a power transmission system that matches the exact pitch of #25 chain while aligning with the 1/2in ION Build System pitch. This makes RT25 a drop in alternative to #25 chain and sprockets with the advantages of a belt driven system. RT25 provides the strength and torque capacity needed for drivetrains, intakes, shooters, and other high demand mechanisms while offering lower weight and higher speed capability than chain. Features On pitch with the…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/RT25-Pulleys/?sku=REV-25-2284', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/699/images/3306/REV-21-2200-RT25Pulleys-FamilyHero-May2024-FINAL__59764.1716584345.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('4in Wheel Gear Ratio for 2 Motor Drivetrain Gearbox - Through Bore', 'REV-25-2514', 'This product is a 4in Wheel Gear Ratio for the 2 Motor Drivetrain Gearbox - Through Bore. Purchasing a Base Kit, Gear Ratio, and Speed Option are all required to assemble a full gearbox, visit the 2 Motor Drivetrain Gearbox - Through Bore (REV-21-2190) page to learn more. Kit Contents SKU PRODUCT NAME QUANTITY REV-21-1931 20DP Gear - 1/2in Hex - 40T QTY 1 REV-21-3023 20DP Gear - MAXSpline - 58T QTY 1', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-25-2514/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/737/images/2966/REV-25-2514-4inWheelGearRatio-Hero-FINAL__69712.1664829566.500.500.png?c=2', null, 'rev'),
  ('5in Wheel Gear Ratio for 2 Motor Drivetrain Gearbox - Through Bore', 'REV-25-2515', 'This product is a 5in Wheel Gear Ratio for the 2 Motor Drivetrain Gearbox - Through Bore. Purchasing a Base Kit, Gear Ratio, and Speed Option are all required to assemble a full gearbox, visit the 2 Motor Drivetrain Gearbox - Through Bore (REV-21-2190) page to learn more. Kit Contents SKU PRODUCT NAME QUANTITY REV-21-1928 20DP Gear - 1/2in Hex - 34T QTY 1 REV-21-3026 20DP Gear - MAXSpline - 64T QTY 1', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-25-2515/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/738/images/2967/REV-25-2515-5inWheelGearRatio-Hero-FINAL__84863.1664829584.500.500.png?c=2', null, 'rev'),
  ('6in Wheel Gear Ratio for 2 Motor Drivetrain Gearbox - Through Bore', 'REV-25-2516', 'This product is a 6in Wheel Gear Ratio for the 2 Motor Drivetrain Gearbox - Through Bore. Purchasing a Base Kit, Gear Ratio, and Speed Option are all required to assemble a full gearbox, visit the 2 Motor Drivetrain Gearbox - Through Bore (REV-21-2190) page to learn more. Kit Contents SKU PRODUCT NAME QUANTITY REV-21-1926 20DP Gear - 1/2in Hex - 30T QTY 1 REV-21-3028 20DP Gear - MAXSpline - 68T QTY 1', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-25-2516/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/739/images/2968/REV-25-2516-6inWheelGearRatio-Hero-FINAL__04660.1664829598.500.500.png?c=2', null, 'rev'),
  ('MAX 180 Degree Gearbox', 'REV-25-2741', 'The MAX 180 Degree Gearbox is compatible with the REV ION System and is designed to give you extra flexibility in your robot construction. E ngineered to let you flip your motor 180 degrees to the output, optimizing space for tighter packaging. This gearbox mounts directly to various components such as the MAXPlanetary (using the MAXPlanetary 1/2in Hex Input Coupler), the Linear Actuator - 12in Stroke, or any other REV gearbox or MAXTube featuring a 2in mounting pattern. Choose between…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-25-2741/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/814/images/3213/REV-25-2741-180Degree-OutputKit-Hero-FINAL__89740.1703881452.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Motion / Gearboxes', 'rev'),
  ('V-Groove Bearing', 'REV-29-1014', 'Bearings 15T Spline Bearing - Flanged - 1.125in OD - 4 Pack (REV-21-3294-PK4) Featuring a 8mm internal diameter and a 1.125in outer diameter, this bearing is designed to fit into a MAXSpline bore while supporting a 15T Spline shaft. The flange adds a way to retain it in place while this bearing supports high-speed loads from many forms of mechanisms that are driven by a 15T Spline shaft including supporting the end of motor shafts. 1/2in Hex Bearing - Flanged - 1.125in OD - 4 Pack…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-Bearings/?sku=REV-29-1014', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/871/images/3433/ION_Bearings-Family-Hero-FINAL__10655.1733763769.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('#10-32 Low Profile Nylon Lock Nut - 100 Pack', 'REV-29-1016-PK100', 'These Low Profile Nylon Lock Nuts are thin enough to fit inside the channel of the ION Build System 1in Extrusion. The embedded nylon ring provides tight vibration resistant hold on the threads of the screw. Specifications Material: Zinc-plated Steel Diameter & Thread: #10-32 Thickness: 11/64in Hex Width: 3/8in Documentation ION Build System Guide #10 Hardware Basics CAD & Drawings REV-29-1016 STEP File REV-29-1016 ONSHAPE', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-29-1016/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/293/images/1050/REV-29-1016-1__51301.1603467943.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('#10-32 1-1/2in Button-head Socket Cap Screw - 5 Pack', 'REV-29-1220-PK5', 'Steel hardware of the appropriate size to work with the ION Build System 1in Extrusion. Length measured from tip to underside of screw head. Specifications Material: 18-8 Stainless Steel Diameter & Thread: #10-32 Length: 1-1/2in Documentation ION Build System Guide #10 Hardware Basics', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-29-1220/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/324/images/1110/10-32_1.5_Button_Head_Screw__32294.1515219237.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Hardware & Tools / Fasteners', 'rev'),
  ('#10-32 1/2in Button-head Socket Cap Screw - 100 Pack', 'REV-29-1222-PK100', 'Steel hardware of the appropriate size to work with the ION Build System 1in Extrusion. Length measured from tip to underside of screw head. Specifications Material: 18-8 Stainless Steel Diameter & Thread: #10-32 Length: 1/2in Documentation ION Build System Guide #10 Hardware Basics CAD & Drawings REV-29-1222 STEP File', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/10-32-Button-head-socket-cap-screws/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/898/images/3525/REV-29-1222-PK100_Picture__31818.1756416381.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Hardware & Tools / Fasteners', 'rev'),
  ('#10-32 1/2in Flat-head Socket Cap Screw - 25 Pack', 'REV-29-1223-PK25', 'Steel hardware of the appropriate size to work with the ION Build System 1in Extrusion. Length includes the flat screw head. Specifications Material: 18-8 Stainless Steel Diameter & Thread: #10-32 Length: 1/2in Documentation ION Build System Guide #10 Hardware Basics CAD & Drawings REV-29-1223 STEP File', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-29-1223/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/320/images/1094/1-2_Flat-head_Socket_Cap_Screw_Lone__49661.1513383667.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Hardware & Tools / Fasteners', 'rev'),
  ('3/8in Split Lock Washer - 25 Pack', 'REV-29-1240-PK25', 'Split Lock washer with a 3/8in inner diameter. Specifications Material: Zinc-plated Steel ID: 3/8in OD: 0.680in Thickness: 0.094in Documentation ION Build System Guide #10 Hardware Basics CAD & Drawings REV-29-1240 Drawing', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-29-1240/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/326/images/1112/3-8_Split_Washer__82024.1603469861.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Hardware & Tools / Fasteners', 'rev'),
  ('Eye-to-Eye Turnbuckle', 'REV-29-1241', 'This Eye-to-Eye Turnbuckle is ideal for tensioning string, cordage, or cabling in linear motion applications. The welded eyes provide significantly more strength than bent eyes. Specifications Material: Steel Thread: M5 Retracted Length: 106mm +- 1mm Extended Length: 148mm +- 1mm Maximum Adjustment: 42mm Eye Shape: Round Eye ID: 10mm +- 1mm Eye OD: 19mm +- 1mm CAD & Drawings REV-29-1241 STEP File REV-29-1241 Onshape REV-29-1241 Drawing', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-29-1241/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/329/images/1115/M4_Turnbuckle__46652.1515213147.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Hardware & Tools / Fasteners', 'rev'),
  ('3mm UHMWPE Cord - 10m', 'REV-29-1244', '1.2mm UHMWPE Cord - 10M (REV-41-1162) is a high strength string for use with the small Pulley Bearings and the 15mm Linear Motion Kit to create a powered lift. 3mm UHMWPE Cord - 10m (REV-29-1244) is a high-strength and low-stretch cord that is ideal for actuating lifts and other linear mechanisms. Also known as Spectra or Dyneema, this cord type minimizes the need for adjustments and re-tensioning after first assembly due to its low-stretch properties. Specifications Material:…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/UHMWPE-Cords/?sku=REV-29-1244', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/968/images/3814/REV-41-1162-1244_UHMWPECords_FAMILY_FINAL__45422.1778771472.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / FTC Team Discount Program', 'rev'),
