  ('Button Head Hex Drive Screws #10-32 x 2-1/4in - 25 Pack', 'REV-29-2960-PK25', 'Steel hardware of the appropriate size to work with the REV ION System. Length measured from tip to underside of screw head. Documentation ION Build System Guide Hardware Basics Onshape Application Examples Product Options SKU PRODUCT NAME CAD & DRAWINGS REV-29-2939-PK50 Button Head Hex Drive Screws #10-32 x1/4in - 50 Pack STEP FILE ONSHAPE DRAWING REV-29-2940-PK50 Button Head Hex Drive Screws #10-32 x5/16in - 50 Pack STEP FILE ONSHAPE DRAWING REV-29-2941-PK50 Button Head Hex Drive Screws…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/10-32-Button-Head-Hex-Drive-Screws/?sku=REV-29-2960-PK25', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/703/images/2995/REV-29-0000-10-32-ButtonHeadSocketCapScrew-New-HeroFINAL__42827.1666205128.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('Button Head Hex Drive Screws #10-32 x2-1/2in - 25 Pack', 'REV-29-2961-PK25', 'Steel hardware of the appropriate size to work with the REV ION System. Length measured from tip to underside of screw head. Documentation ION Build System Guide Hardware Basics Onshape Application Examples Product Options SKU PRODUCT NAME CAD & DRAWINGS REV-29-2939-PK50 Button Head Hex Drive Screws #10-32 x1/4in - 50 Pack STEP FILE ONSHAPE DRAWING REV-29-2940-PK50 Button Head Hex Drive Screws #10-32 x5/16in - 50 Pack STEP FILE ONSHAPE DRAWING REV-29-2941-PK50 Button Head Hex Drive Screws…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/10-32-Button-Head-Hex-Drive-Screws/?sku=REV-29-2961-PK25', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/703/images/2995/REV-29-0000-10-32-ButtonHeadSocketCapScrew-New-HeroFINAL__42827.1666205128.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('Button Head Hex Drive Screws #10-32 x 2-3/4in - 25 Pack', 'REV-29-2962-PK25', 'Steel hardware of the appropriate size to work with the REV ION System. Length measured from tip to underside of screw head. Documentation ION Build System Guide Hardware Basics Onshape Application Examples Product Options SKU PRODUCT NAME CAD & DRAWINGS REV-29-2939-PK50 Button Head Hex Drive Screws #10-32 x1/4in - 50 Pack STEP FILE ONSHAPE DRAWING REV-29-2940-PK50 Button Head Hex Drive Screws #10-32 x5/16in - 50 Pack STEP FILE ONSHAPE DRAWING REV-29-2941-PK50 Button Head Hex Drive Screws…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/10-32-Button-Head-Hex-Drive-Screws/?sku=REV-29-2962-PK25', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/703/images/2995/REV-29-0000-10-32-ButtonHeadSocketCapScrew-New-HeroFINAL__42827.1666205128.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('Button Head Hex Drive Screws #10-32 x3in - 25 Pack', 'REV-29-2963-PK25', 'Steel hardware of the appropriate size to work with the REV ION System. Length measured from tip to underside of screw head. Documentation ION Build System Guide Hardware Basics Onshape Application Examples Product Options SKU PRODUCT NAME CAD & DRAWINGS REV-29-2939-PK50 Button Head Hex Drive Screws #10-32 x1/4in - 50 Pack STEP FILE ONSHAPE DRAWING REV-29-2940-PK50 Button Head Hex Drive Screws #10-32 x5/16in - 50 Pack STEP FILE ONSHAPE DRAWING REV-29-2941-PK50 Button Head Hex Drive Screws…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/10-32-Button-Head-Hex-Drive-Screws/?sku=REV-29-2963-PK25', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/703/images/2995/REV-29-0000-10-32-ButtonHeadSocketCapScrew-New-HeroFINAL__42827.1666205128.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('3/16in Rivet - 0.126-0.250in Grip Length - 100 Pack', 'REV-29-2971-PK100', '3/16in Rivets are compatible with the REV ION System are perfect for a variety of applications where a strong, permanent joint is required. P lace the rivet into a hole from a single side (a "blind" hole) and then use a rivet gun to expand the end of the rivet to create a secure and permanent hold. The rivets function similar to a bolt in that it aligns and holds parts together through a common hole. The rivet can be removed by drilling it out. Features Compatible with REV ION structure…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/3/16in-Rivets/?sku=REV-29-2971-PK100', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/763/images/3063/REV-21-0000-2970-2972-Rivets-FamilyHero-FINAL__00032.1670950838.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('3/16in Rivet - 0.251-0.375in Grip Length - 100 Pack', 'REV-29-2972-PK100', '3/16in Rivets are compatible with the REV ION System are perfect for a variety of applications where a strong, permanent joint is required. P lace the rivet into a hole from a single side (a "blind" hole) and then use a rivet gun to expand the end of the rivet to create a secure and permanent hold. The rivets function similar to a bolt in that it aligns and holds parts together through a common hole. The rivet can be removed by drilling it out. Features Compatible with REV ION structure…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/3/16in-Rivets/?sku=REV-29-2972-PK100', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/763/images/3063/REV-21-0000-2970-2972-Rivets-FamilyHero-FINAL__00032.1670950838.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('MAXSpline Bearing - Flanged - 2 Pack', 'REV-29-3295-PK2', 'The MAXSpline Shaft Bearing Block Kit and MAXSpline Bearings are compatible with the REV ION System and are perfect for using MAXSpline Shaft in a live axle application or any other similar sized rotational needs. Effortlessly mounting to REV''s hole pattern standards, these blocks are quick and versatile. Get things prototyped quickly with the flexibility of adjustment to deploy or create your perfect mechanisms! REV recommends supporting most applications with a minimum of two MAXSpline Shaft…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/maxspline-shaft-bearing-blocks/?sku=REV-29-3295-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/818/images/3257/REV-21-0000-MAXSplineShaftBearingBlockSideMount-FamilyHero-FINAL__02108.1704464648.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Motion / Bearings, Shafts, & Spacers', 'rev'),
  ('MAXSpline Bearing - Radial - 2 Pack', 'REV-29-3296-PK2', 'The MAXSpline Shaft Bearing Block Kit and MAXSpline Bearings are compatible with the REV ION System and are perfect for using MAXSpline Shaft in a live axle application or any other similar sized rotational needs. Effortlessly mounting to REV''s hole pattern standards, these blocks are quick and versatile. Get things prototyped quickly with the flexibility of adjustment to deploy or create your perfect mechanisms! REV recommends supporting most applications with a minimum of two MAXSpline Shaft…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/maxspline-shaft-bearing-blocks/?sku=REV-29-3296-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/818/images/3257/REV-21-0000-MAXSplineShaftBearingBlockSideMount-FamilyHero-FINAL__02108.1704464648.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Motion / Bearings, Shafts, & Spacers', 'rev'),
  ('SRS Programmer', 'REV-31-1108', 'The REV Robotics SRS Programmer is the key to unlocking all the smart features of the (SRS) Smart Robot Servo (sold separately). Switching between continuous rotation, standard servo, and custom angular modes is easy as pressing a button. The SRS Programmer can not only program the SRS, but it is also acts as a standalone servo tester for any standard RC servo. Specifications Programming modes Continuous rotation Angular limits Reset to factory defaults Test modes Automatic sweep Manual…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-31-1108/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/116/images/634/REV-31-1108-1__84485.1603470088.500.500.JPG?c=2', 'REV DUO / Motion / Motors & Servos', 'rev'),
  ('REV Robotics Expansion Hub', 'REV-31-1153', 'The REV Robotics Expansion Hub is a low-cost educational device that can communicate with any computer (commonly the REV Robotics Control Hub or Driver Hub) to provide the interfaces required for building robots and other mechatronics. The Expansion Hub was purpose built to stand up to the rigors of the classroom and competition field. It features a mature firmware designed for basic and advanced use cases with the ability to be field upgraded in the future. The REV Robotics Expansion Hub is…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-31-1153/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/216/images/2784/Expansion_Hub_One-noflag__63205.1650572103.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Control System', 'rev'),
  ('Expansion Hub Repair Service', 'REV-31-1153-RFB', 'This product is an Expansion Hub Repair Service, NOT a way to purchase a Expansion Hub. We strongly recommend reviewing the Hub Repair Service section of our Warranty and Returns page and contacting support@revrobotics.com before purchasing this item. Instructions Step 1: Contact Support Email support@revrobotics.com with details about the issue. Many issues can be resolved remotely without sending the Hub back. Step 2: Purchase A Repair Service (if needed) If the issue cannot be resolved…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-31-1153-rfb/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/337/images/1155/REV-31-1153_expansion_hub_Repair_Service__56281.1618523820.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Control System', 'rev'),
  ('Potentiometer', 'REV-31-1155', 'This 10K potentiometer can be used as an analog sensor with the Control Hub or Expansion Hub. This potentiometer has a 270 degree range of motion and can be mounted to any REV DUO brackets with the Motion Pattern, like the Motion Bracket. The input shaft is a 5mm hex socket so it can be mounted to end of any of the REV DUO 5mm Hex Shafts to give sensor feedback on simple arm joint. Be careful not to force the input shaft past the end of the sensors range or it can become damaged.…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-31-1155/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/218/images/2710/REV-31-1155_Pot1__52143.1650558869.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Sensors', 'rev'),
  ('SPARKmini Motor Controller', 'REV-31-1230', 'The SPARKmini Motor Controller is an inexpensive in-line brushed DC motor controller designed to offer the same performance characteristics as the Control Hub (REV-31-1595) or Expansion Hub (REV-31-1153) motor ports in a small 60mm x 22mm footprint. The SPARKmini has three integrated wires with connectors dedicated to power, control, and the motor; one(1) XT30 connector for power, one(2) 3-wire servo-PWM connector for control, and one(3) JST-VH connector for the motor. The figure below shows each of…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-31-1230/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/339/images/2709/Spark_Mini_Legal_TEMP-noflag__30764.1650558664.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Control System', 'rev'),
  ('Resistive Grounding Strap', 'REV-31-1269', 'Safely ground your robot''s metal frame with this Resistive Grounding Strap. This strap has a built in 470Ω resistor to prevent high-current discharges while still minimizing the difference in charge between the robot electronics and the frame. Simply plug the XT30 end of the grounding strap into a free XT30 port on your robot and attach the ring-terminal end to a metal part of your frame using a nut and bolt. Specifications Length: 30cm Resistance: 470 Ω 1/2 W 5% Wire Gauge: 22 AWG…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-31-1269/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/358/images/1209/REV-31-1269-ResistiveGroundingStrap__52320.1536076938.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Hardware & Tools / Accessories', 'rev'),
  ('XT30 Power Distribution Block', 'REV-31-1293', 'Easily connect multiple devices to your robot battery with the REV XT30 Power Distribution Block. Allows for clean, compact wiring of all your XT30-connected devices. Compatible with: Expansion Hub, Blinkin LED Driver, SPARKmini, Servo Power Module, and many other devices. Specifications Input: 1 x XT30 Male Connector Output: 6 x XT30 Female Connectors Maximum Current: 20A combined Kit Contents SKU PRODUCT NAME QUANTITY REV-31-1293 XT30 Power Distribution Block QTY 1 REV-31-1392 XT30 Extension…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-31-1293/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/341/images/2695/XT30_Power_Distribution_Block_Hero_noflag__79425.1650555542.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('12V Slim Battery Accessories — Battery Charger', 'REV-31-1299', '12V Slim Battery Accessories help keep your REV 12V Slim Batteries securely mounted, charged, and ready to power your robot. This product family includes the Battery Holder Plate for mounting a REV 12V Battery, Control Hub, or Expansion Hub, as well as the Battery Charger for charging REV 12V Slim Batteries with an XT30 connection. The battery plate (REV-41-1166-PK2) is the perfect size to support a REV 12v Battery, REV Control Hub, or REV Expansion Hub. The battery charger for use with our…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/12V-Slim-Battery-Accessories/?sku=REV-31-1299', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/964/images/3803/REV-31-1299_BatteryAccessories_FAMILY_FINAL__46053.1778539185.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / Electronics / Power System', 'rev'),
  ('12V Slim Battery', 'REV-31-1302', 'This 10-cell, 12V 3000mAh battery has a low profile configuration to make it easier to mount on a robot. The Slim Battery pack is wired with an XT30 female connector and an inline 20A replaceable ATM fuse. XT30 to Tamiya Adapter no longer automatically included as of 5/10/2017. Specification Voltage: 12V Capacity: 3000mAh Weight: 567g Maximum Dimensions: 113.5mm x 90.5mm x 23mm Wire Gauge: 16 AWG Connector: XT30 Replaceable Fuse: 20A ATM Maximum Discharge Rate: 10C While the battery cells are…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-31-1302/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/193/images/2367/REV-31-1302-12VSlimBattery-New-FINAL__87390.1636579008.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('Anderson to JST VH Cable - 12 cm - 4 pack', 'REV-31-1381-PK4', 'Use the Anderson Power Pole to 2-pin JST VH Adapter Cable to connect your existing motors to the REV Robotics Expansion Hub. Teams that already own and use the Anderson Powerpole Crimper may purchase JST VH 2-pin Motor Cables (REV-31-1413), cut cables in half, and crimp the cut end with Anderson Powerpole connectors to create their own Anderson to JST VH cables. Expansion Hub 2-pin JST VH Connections: Motor Power', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-31-1381-pk4/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/255/images/918/AA_15mm_Metal_Servo_Bracket__15222.1497285356.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('Tamiya to XT30 Adapter - 2 Pack', 'REV-31-1382-PK20', 'The 8cm long Anderson Power Pole style connector to Female XT30 adapter cable (REV-31-1385-PK20) is used to covert team-modified battery connectors to the new XT30 connector. Teams that already own and use the Anderson Powerpole Crimper may purchase XT30 Extension Cables (REV-31-1391, -1392, or -1394), cut cables in half, and crimp the Anderson Powerpole connectors to the Female XT30 end of the cable to create their own Anderson Power Pole to XT30 Adapter Cables. The 8cm long Female Tamiya to…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/XT30-adapters?sku=REV-31-1382-PK20', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/967/images/3813/REV-31-1382-85_XT30Adapters_FAMILY_FINAL__91829.1778696455.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / FTC Team Discount Program', 'rev'),
  ('Sensor Cable Adapter for Level Converter', 'REV-31-1384', 'Cross over cable to convert the pin out from Modern Robotic''s I2C sensors to work with the REV Robotics''s Logic Level Converter.', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-31-1384/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/248/images/2778/Sensor_Cable_dapter_for_Level_Shifter__76204.1650571151.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('Anderson Power Pole to XT30 Adapter - 2 Pack', 'REV-31-1385-PK20', 'The 8cm long Anderson Power Pole style connector to Female XT30 adapter cable (REV-31-1385-PK20) is used to covert team-modified battery connectors to the new XT30 connector. Teams that already own and use the Anderson Powerpole Crimper may purchase XT30 Extension Cables (REV-31-1391, -1392, or -1394), cut cables in half, and crimp the Anderson Powerpole connectors to the Female XT30 end of the cable to create their own Anderson Power Pole to XT30 Adapter Cables. The 8cm long Female Tamiya to…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/XT30-adapters?sku=REV-31-1385-PK20', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/967/images/3813/REV-31-1382-85_XT30Adapters_FAMILY_FINAL__91829.1778696455.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / FTC Team Discount Program', 'rev'),
  ('Sensor Splitter Cable - 2 Pack', 'REV-31-1386-PK2', 'The analog and digital ports on the Control Hub and Expansion Hub combine two sensor inputs into one(4) connector to save space. Single sensors plugged directly into these ports will work, but they will block access to the second input. The Sensor Splitter Cable will allow two sensors to be plugged into the same port as needed. Be sure to check that the pinout of your sensor is compatible with this cable as some sensor pinouts will require modification or splicing of the splitter cable to make it…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-31-1386-pk2/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/254/images/914/AA_Sensor_Splitter_Cable__32251.1497279914.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('Switch Cable and Bracket', 'REV-31-1387', 'Install this switch between your battery and Control Hub or Expansion Hub for convenient on/off control of your robot. We recommend mounting the switch slightly recessed from the robot''s exterior to prevent it from being accidentally toggled by another robot during a match. Specifications Rated for greater than 20A using a 12V battery Terminals are Male XT30(1) Female XT30(1) Panel mount in a rectangular hole 27.5mm x 10.6mm Kit Contents SKU PRODUCT NAME QUANTITY Power Switch Assembly QTY 1 Mounting…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-31-1387/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/256/images/2679/REV-31-1387-Switch-Cable-and-Bracket-1-NoFlag-FINAL__58356.1650554802.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('JST PH 4-pin Joiner Board - 4 Pack', 'REV-31-1388-PK4', 'The JST PH 6-pin Joiner Boards (REV-11-1277-PK4) are intended to be used with the JST PH 6-pin Extension Cables to extend the reach of your NEO Brushless Motor sensor cables. The JST VH 2-pin Joiner Board - 4 Pack (REV-31-1429-PK4) are small connector boards that can be used to join two JST VH 2-pin Motor Cables to create a longer cable. The JST PH 4-pin Joiner Board - 4 Pack (REV-31-1388-PK4) are small connectors that can be used to join two JST PH 4-pin Sensor Cables to create a longer cable.', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/JST-Joiner-Boards/?sku=REV-31-1388-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/971/images/3831/REV-11-1277_JSTJoinerBoards_FAMILY_FINAL__44024.1778868134.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('Logic Level Converter', 'REV-31-1389', 'The REV Robotics Logic Level Converter is a circuit board which generates a 5V output from the 3.3V input and uses a MOSFET on each signal line to create a bidirectional communication appropriate for a variety of digital signals include I2C communication. Kit Contents QTY 1 - Logic Level Converter Board QTY 1 - Cable, 4-pin JST PH, 30cm Product Add-on Options Sensor Cable Adapter - use the Logic Level Converter directly with any Modern Robotics I2C sensors', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-31-1389/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/241/images/2754/AA_Level_Shifter_Pack_One__54072.1650567826.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All / Discontinued & Discounted Products', 'rev'),
  ('XT30 Extension Cable - 30cm - 2 Pack', 'REV-31-1392-PK2', 'The XT30 Extension Cable is keyed and locking for improved reliability. Use this cable along with an 3-pin JST PH Cable to connect a second REV Robotics Expansion Hub. Expansion Hub XT30 Connections: Power, one(5) Male and one(6) Female XT30 Connector Product Options SKU PRODUCT NAME REV-31-1392-PK2 XT30 Extension Cable - 30cm - 2 Pack REV-31-1394-PK2 XT30 Extension Cable - 50cm - 2 Pack', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/XT30-Extension-Cables/?sku=REV-31-1392-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/267/images/905/XT30_extension__07089.1603473877.500.500.jpg?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('XT30 Extension Cable - 50cm - 2 Pack', 'REV-31-1394-PK2', 'The XT30 Extension Cable is keyed and locking for improved reliability. Use this cable along with an 3-pin JST PH Cable to connect a second REV Robotics Expansion Hub. Expansion Hub XT30 Connections: Power, one(7) Male and one(8) Female XT30 Connector Product Options SKU PRODUCT NAME REV-31-1392-PK2 XT30 Extension Cable - 30cm - 2 Pack REV-31-1394-PK2 XT30 Extension Cable - 50cm - 2 Pack', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/XT30-Extension-Cables/?sku=REV-31-1394-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/267/images/905/XT30_extension__07089.1603473877.500.500.jpg?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('XT30 Connectors - 5 pairs', 'REV-31-1399-PK5', 'Use these connectors to create your own custom length power wires. The XT30 Connector uses a solder cup instead of a crimping tool to connect the contact to a wire.', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-31-1399-pk5/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/252/images/2348/REV-31-1399-XT30_Connectors_Pile-FINAL__04315.1636407494.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('JST PH 4-pin Sensor Cables', 'REV-31-1408-PK4', 'The 4-pin JST PH Cable is keyed and locking for improved reliability. Expansion Hub 4-pin JST PH Connections: Motor Encoder Digital Analog I2C Product Options SKU PRODUCT NAME REV-31-1407-PK4 JST PH 4-pin Sensor Cable - 30cm - 4 Pack REV-31-1408-PK4 JST PH 4-pin Sensor Cable - 50cm - 4 Pack REV-31-1409-PK4 JST PH 4-pin Sensor Cable - 100cm - 4 Pack', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/JST-PH-4-pin-Sensor-Cables/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/263/images/876/JST_PH_4pin_30cm_REV-31-1407__92491.1613072598.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('JST VH 2-pin Motor Cables', 'REV-31-1413-PK4', 'The 2-pin JST VH Cable is keyed and locking for improved reliability. Expansion Hub 2-pin JST VH Connections: Motor Power Product Options SKU PRODUCT NAME REV-31-1412-PK4 JST VH 2-pin Motor Cable - 30cm - 4 Pack REV-31-1413-PK4 JST VH 2-pin Motor Cable - 50cm - 4 Pack REV-31-1526-PK4 JST VH 2-pin Motor Cable - 100cm - 4 Pack', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/JST-VH-2-pin-Motor-Cables/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/265/images/2345/REV-31-1413-JSTVH-Hero-FINAL__66749.1636397287.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('JST PH 3-pin Communication Cables', 'REV-31-1418-PK2', 'The 3-pin JST PH Cable is keyed and locking for improved reliability. Use this cable along with an XT30 Extension cable to connect a second REV Robotics Expansion Hub. Expansion Hub 3-pin JST PH Connections: RS485 - Daisy-chain communication to a second Expansion Hub UART Product Options SKU PRODUCT NAME REV-31-1417-PK2 JST PH 3-pin Communication Cable - 30cm - 2 Pack REV-31-1418-PK2 JST PH 3-pin Communication Cable - 50cm - 2 Pack REV-31-1565-PK2 JST PH 3-pin Communication Cable - 100cm - 2…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/JST-PH-3-Pin-Communication-Cables/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/363/images/1223/JST_PH_3-Pin_Comm__91198.1618525045.500.500.jpg?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('Touch Sensor', 'REV-31-1425', 'Touch sensor is best used for user input, but can also be used as a limit switch. Configuration The REV Touch Sensor is a digital sensor that is wired to the N+1 channel on our standard 4-pin JST PH connector. In other words, the REV Expansion Hub digital ports are grouped with two input/output channels per port: 0-1, 2-3, 4-5, 6-7. In general we refer to each channel as N and N+1. When pressed, the touch sensor pulls the digital channel low from its default high state. Kit Contents QTY 1 -…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-31-1425/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/242/images/2785/Button_Sensor_REV-31-1425_2_not_lm__15755.1650572167.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Sensors', 'rev'),
  ('JST VH 2-pin Joiner Board - 4 Pack', 'REV-31-1429-PK4', 'The JST PH 6-pin Joiner Boards (REV-11-1277-PK4) are intended to be used with the JST PH 6-pin Extension Cables to extend the reach of your NEO Brushless Motor sensor cables. The JST VH 2-pin Joiner Board - 4 Pack (REV-31-1429-PK4) are small connector boards that can be used to join two JST VH 2-pin Motor Cables to create a longer cable. The JST PH 4-pin Joiner Board - 4 Pack (REV-31-1388-PK4) are small connectors that can be used to join two JST PH 4-pin Sensor Cables to create a longer cable.', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/JST-Joiner-Boards/?sku=REV-31-1429-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/971/images/3831/REV-11-1277_JSTJoinerBoards_FAMILY_FINAL__44024.1778868134.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('Magnetic Limit Switch', 'REV-31-1462', 'The Magnetic Limit Switch is a three-sided active-low digital hall effect switch with three internal hall effect elements located on the top and sides of the sensor. The three elements are connected in parallel so that any one(9) of them will trigger the sensor. Hall effect sensors detect the presence of magnetic fields. The Magnetic Limit Switch is an omnipolar momentary switch meaning it will trigger when there is sufficient field strength of either magnetic pole (north or south) detected.…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-31-1462/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/285/images/2690/Lone_Hall_Sensor__00715.1650555551.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Sensors', 'rev'),
  ('2m Distance Sensor', 'REV-31-1505', 'The REV Robotics 2m Distance Sensor uses the ST Microelectronics VL53L0X Time-of-Flight (ToF) laser-ranging module to measure distances up to 2 meters with millimeter resolution. Unlike other ranging sensors that rely on the intensity of reflected light, this sensor can measure how long it takes for the light to bounce back, the "time of flight." This results in much more accurate measurements that are independent of the target''s reflectance. Specifications Measurement Range: 5cm - 200cm…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-31-1505/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/340/images/2734/2M_Distance_Sensor__87798.1650562207.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Sensors', 'rev'),
  ('Color Sensor V2', 'REV-31-1537', 'This product is no longer in production and is only available as long as supplies last. This product has been replaced with Color Sensor V3 (REV-31-1557). Version 3 of the REV Color Sensor introduces a new sensor chip by Broadcom due to the end of life of the V1/V2 sensor. Physical form factor is the same as V2, however there are some minor changes to the FTC SDK. Be sure to update to the latest SDK and configure your robot to use the "REV Color / Range Sensor V3". Color values will not be…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-31-1537/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/342/images/2718/Color_Sensor_V2__25867.1650559502.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Sensors', 'rev'),
  ('Color Sensor V3', 'REV-31-1557', 'This sensor can be used to read and compare colors, and also has a built-in IR (optical) Proximity Sensor and white LED for active target lighting. Supports High Speed I2C Communication (400kHz) as well as auto increment register read which allows the user to return all the color register and status register data in one(10) read command instead of 4 separate read commands. Version 3 of the REV Color Sensor introduces a new sensor chip by Broadcom due to the end of life of the V1/V2 sensor.…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-31-1557/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/507/images/2717/Color_Sensor_V2__58545.1650559332.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Sensors', 'rev'),
  ('UltraUSB Hub and Cables', 'REV-31-1592', 'The UltraUSB Hub is designed specifically for use in competitive robotics, and gives you the ability to connect multiple USB devices to each other as well as replacing cables when damaged instead of needing to replace the whole hub. The UltraUSB Hub can also be powered externally, allowing for USB peripherals like the Logitech C270 UVC USB Camera and Logitech F310 USB Gamepad to operate with the power they need. The UltraUSB Hub Power to USB A Cable is used to power the UltraUSB Hub off a 5V…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/UltraUSB-Hub-and-Cables/?sku=REV-31-1592', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/905/images/3545/Ultra_USB_Hub_Hero__29396.1790011784.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('Control Hub', 'REV-31-1595', 'The REV Robotics Control Hub is an affordable all-in-one(11) educational robotics controller. It provides students all the necessary interfaces for robotics and mechatronics projects with multiple programming language options. The Control Hub is purpose-built to stand up to the rigors of the classroom and the competition field with ESD and reverse polarity protection. Running the Android operating system gives the Control Hub the flexibility to control both basic and advanced robots while also…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-31-1595/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/391/images/2736/IMG_20170502_154043_not_lm__25913.1650563042.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('Control Hub Repair Service', 'REV-31-1595-RFB', 'This product is a Control Hub Repair Service, NOT a way to purchase a Control Hub. We strongly recommend reviewing the Hub Repair Service section of our Warranty and Returns page and contacting support@revrobotics.com before purchasing this item. Instructions Step 1: Contact Support Email support@revrobotics.com with details about the issue. Many issues can be resolved remotely without sending the Hub back. Step 2: Purchase A Repair Service (if needed) If the issue cannot be resolved remotely,…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-31-1595-rfb/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/573/images/3878/REV-31-1595_RepairService_Edited_FINAL__75955.1789595581.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Control System', 'rev'),
  ('Driver Hub', 'REV-31-1596', 'The REV Driver Hub is a compact mobile computing device designed for interfacing with the Control Hub (REV-31-1595). The Driver Hub was designed and built as an easy to use, dependable, and durable device for use in classroom and the competition. It features an Android operating system, built-in dual band Wi-Fi (802.11 ac/b/g/n/w), and support for many off-the-shelf gamepads and HID devices connected through built-in USB ports. When the Driver Hub software is updated with new features, the…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-31-1596/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/598/images/2741/REV-31-1596-Driver_Hub-Iso_View-FINAL__03867.1650564025.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Control System', 'rev'),
  ('Driver Hub Repair Service', 'REV-31-1596-RFB', 'This product is a Driver Hub Repair Service, NOT a way to purchase a Driver Hub. We strongly recommend reviewing the Hub Repair Service section of our Warranty and Returns page and contacting support@revrobotics.com before purchasing this item. Instructions Step 1: Contact Support Email support@revrobotics.com with details about the issue. Many issues can be resolved remotely without sending the Hub back. Step 2: Purchase A Repair Service (if needed) If the issue cannot be resolved remotely,…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-31-1596-rfb/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/770/images/3083/REV-31-1596-RFB-Driver_Hub_Repair_Service__75656.1673535944.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Control System', 'rev'),
  ('USB Female A to Micro USB Adapter - Orange', 'REV-31-1807', 'The USB Female A to Micro USB Adapter allows you to use standard USB devices with micro 5-pin oriented electronics. Use this cable adapter to connect a Robot Controller phone to an Expansion Hub, or to connect a Driver''s Station phone to a single gamepad such as the Etpark Wired Controller. Specifications Standard USB 2.0 port Right angle micro USB OTG connector Orange', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-31-1807/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/575/images/2073/REV-31-1807-USB_Female_A_to_Micro_USB_Adapter-Side-FINAL__58371.1620666063.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('UltraUSB Hub Upstream to USB Micro-B OTG Cable', 'REV-31-1811', 'The UltraUSB Hub is designed specifically for use in competitive robotics, and gives you the ability to connect multiple USB devices to each other as well as replacing cables when damaged instead of needing to replace the whole hub. The UltraUSB Hub can also be powered externally, allowing for USB peripherals like the Logitech C270 UVC USB Camera and Logitech F310 USB Gamepad to operate with the power they need. The UltraUSB Hub Power to USB A Cable is used to power the UltraUSB Hub off a 5V…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/UltraUSB-Hub-and-Cables/?sku=REV-31-1811', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/905/images/3545/Ultra_USB_Hub_Hero__29396.1790011784.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('UltraUSB Hub Upstream to USB A Cable', 'REV-31-1812', 'The UltraUSB Hub is designed specifically for use in competitive robotics, and gives you the ability to connect multiple USB devices to each other as well as replacing cables when damaged instead of needing to replace the whole hub. The UltraUSB Hub can also be powered externally, allowing for USB peripherals like the Logitech C270 UVC USB Camera and Logitech F310 USB Gamepad to operate with the power they need. The UltraUSB Hub Power to USB A Cable is used to power the UltraUSB Hub off a 5V…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/UltraUSB-Hub-and-Cables/?sku=REV-31-1812', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/905/images/3545/Ultra_USB_Hub_Hero__29396.1790011784.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('UltraUSB Hub Power to PWM Cable', 'REV-31-1813', 'The UltraUSB Hub is designed specifically for use in competitive robotics, and gives you the ability to connect multiple USB devices to each other as well as replacing cables when damaged instead of needing to replace the whole hub. The UltraUSB Hub can also be powered externally, allowing for USB peripherals like the Logitech C270 UVC USB Camera and Logitech F310 USB Gamepad to operate with the power they need. The UltraUSB Hub Power to USB A Cable is used to power the UltraUSB Hub off a 5V…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/UltraUSB-Hub-and-Cables/?sku=REV-31-1813', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/905/images/3545/Ultra_USB_Hub_Hero__29396.1790011784.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('UltraUSB Hub Power to USB A Cable', 'REV-31-1814', 'The UltraUSB Hub is designed specifically for use in competitive robotics, and gives you the ability to connect multiple USB devices to each other as well as replacing cables when damaged instead of needing to replace the whole hub. The UltraUSB Hub can also be powered externally, allowing for USB peripherals like the Logitech C270 UVC USB Camera and Logitech F310 USB Gamepad to operate with the power they need. The UltraUSB Hub Power to USB A Cable is used to power the UltraUSB Hub off a 5V…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/UltraUSB-Hub-and-Cables/?sku=REV-31-1814', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/905/images/3545/Ultra_USB_Hub_Hero__29396.1790011784.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('JST PH 6-pin to JST PH 4-pin Encoder Adapter Cable - 50cm', 'REV-31-1815', 'The JST PH 6-pin to JST PH 4-pin Cable allows for seamless connection of the Through Bore Encoder to the dedicated encoder ports on the FTC Control System (Expansion Hub or Control Hub). Also allows for the HD Hex Motor to connect directly to a SPARK MAX through the SPARK MAX''s encoder port.', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-31-1815/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/513/images/1542/JST_PH_6-Pin_to_JST_PH_4-Pin_Cable_50cm__22889.1578591885.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('Driver Hub Battery', 'REV-31-1876', 'Replacement battery for the Driver Hub (REV-31-1596). Specifications 5040 mAH Li-ion battery Documentation Driver Hub User''s Manual Driver Hub Getting Started Guide Driver Hub Battery Best Practices', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-31-1876/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/609/images/2179/REV-31-1876---Driver-Hub-Battery-FINAL__71069.1631043369.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Control System', 'rev'),
  ('Digital LED Indicator - Red/Green - 4 Pack', 'REV-31-2010-PK4', 'The Digital LED Indicator is a LED signal module that is digitally controlled (active low) and offers three colors: red, green, and amber. The Digital LED Indicator is designed to directly interface with the DIO ports of the Expansion Hub or Control Hub. Note: When using the Digital LED Indicator outside of the REV Hub environment, make sure to check that your device GPIO pins'' current sink rating can handle 20mA. Specifications Operating Voltage: 3.3V Current Draw (at 3.3V): 20mA (when one(12)…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-31-2010/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/576/images/1784/REV-31-2010-Digital-LED-Indicator-Back-FINAL__95304.1670952526.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Sensors', 'rev'),
  ('REV USB PS4 Compatible Gamepad', 'REV-31-2983', 'The REV USB PS4 Compatible Gamepad is compatible with both the REV DUO and REV ION Systems. Plug the REV Gamepad directly into a Driver Hub to enable feature rich control of your robot. Additionally, when plugged into a PC, it offers an Xbox compatibility mode. This mode may alter some functionality. The REV USB PS4 Compatible Gamepad has two remappable M-buttons on the back side of the controller. Simply press and hold the M button you are wanting to remap then press the programming button in…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-31-2983/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/829/images/3518/REV-31-2983-REVUSBPS4CompatibleGamepad-Hero-FINAL-new__77925.1753717119.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Control System', 'rev'),
  ('9-Axis IMU', 'REV-31-3332', 'The 9-Axis IMU, compatible with the REV DUO System, is a high-performance inertial measurement unit (IMU) featuring the Bosch BNO055 smart sensor with an integrated accelerometer, gyroscope, and magnetometer. Developed to be plug and play with the REV Control Hub (REV-31-1595) or Expansion Hub (REV-31-1153) using an I2C port. The 9-Axis IMU uses an alternate I2C address (0x29) so it can be used with the expansion hub or control hub without conflicting with the internal IMU. The 9-Axis IMU can…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-31-3332/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/848/images/3367/REV-31-3332-9AxisIMU-HERO-FINAL__79949.1731351709.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Sensors', 'rev'),
  ('Ferrite Cable Clip - 4 Pack', 'REV-39-1224-PK4', 'These Ferrite Cable Clips help prevent electromagnetic interference (EMI). They can be clipped around USB and other data cables that are being used in electrically noisy environments.', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-39-1224-pk4/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/377/images/1228/Ferrite_Clips_Pile__89855.1546030646.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Extrusion - 1m - 90° Ends - Clear Anodized', 'REV-41-1017', 'REV Building System also comes in a 15mm x 30mm square extrusion. The slots are designed to fit standard M3 hardware rather than expensive t-nuts. Use the 15mm x 30mm extrusion when more strength is needed for an application. For smaller applications the REV Building System also comes in a 15mm x 15mm square extrusion. The slots are designed to fit standard M3 hardware rather than expensive t-nuts. This product (REV-41-1568-PK2) is a 2-pack of 120mm pieces of extrusion, for when you need a…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-extrusions/?sku=REV-41-1017', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/908/images/3593/15mmExtrusions_FAMILY_FINAL__33113.1760640309.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO', 'rev'),
  ('20:1 Hex Gearbox & Pinion', 'REV-41-1064', 'This gearbox is the same one(13) used on our HD Hex Motor 20:1 Spur Gearbox featuring our 5mm HEX output shaft! This gearbox can be installed on any 550 series motors (like the NeveRest motors from AndyMark) giving you the convenience and flexibility of a compact gear reduction with an easier to work with output shaft. The hex output shaft is compatible with all of our gears, sprockets and wheels with NO more hubs or Setscrews required. The pinion gear is included to make it easy to mount any…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1064/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/283/images/2749/REV-41-1065-40-to-1-Hex-Gearbox--Pinion-NOFlag-FINAL__61202.1650564848.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All / Discontinued & Discounted Products', 'rev'),
  ('40:1 Hex Gearbox & Pinion', 'REV-41-1065', 'This gearbox is the same one(14) used on our HD Hex Motor 40:1 Spur Gearbox featuring our 5mm HEX output shaft! This gearbox can be installed on any 550 series motors (like the NeveRest motors from AndyMark) giving you the convenience and flexibility of a compact gear reduction with an easier to work with output shaft. The hex output shaft is compatible with all of our gears, sprockets and wheels with NO more hubs or Setscrews required. The pinion gear is included to make it easy to mount any…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1065/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/208/images/2691/REV-41-1065-40-to-1-Hex-Gearbox--Pinion-NOFlag-FINAL__80541.1650555244.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All / Discontinued & Discounted Products', 'rev'),
  ('15mm x 30mm Extrusion - 1m - 90° Ends - Clear Anodized', 'REV-41-1093', 'REV Building System also comes in a 15mm x 30mm square extrusion. The slots are designed to fit standard M3 hardware rather than expensive t-nuts. Use the 15mm x 30mm extrusion when more strength is needed for an application. For smaller applications the REV Building System also comes in a 15mm x 15mm square extrusion. The slots are designed to fit standard M3 hardware rather than expensive t-nuts. This product (REV-41-1568-PK2) is a 2-pack of 120mm pieces of extrusion, for when you need a…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-extrusions/?sku=REV-41-1093', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/908/images/3593/15mmExtrusions_FAMILY_FINAL__33113.1760640309.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO', 'rev'),
  ('ION Servo Accessories', 'REV-41-1097', 'ION Servo Accessories allow for easy integration into REV ION System. Mount a hobby sided servo, such as the REV Smart Robot Servo, on a 1/2in pitch. Using the adapters, you can convert a servo to a 1/2in Hex shaft for use with all other ION mechanical system components. Documentation ION Build System Guide Onshape Application Examples Product Options SKU PRODUCT NAME CAD & DRAWINGS REV-21-2892 1/2in Rounded Hex Servo Shaft STEP FILE ONSHAPE DRAWING REV-21-2895 1/2in Hex Linkage Arm STEP FILE…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-Servo-Accessories/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/697/images/3120/REV-21-2890-2899-IONServoAccessories-FamilyHero-FINAL__04041.1676043295.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Motion / Motors & Servos', 'rev'),
  ('5.5mm Nut Driver', 'REV-41-1119', 'Small electronics sized 5.5mm Nut Driver with rubberised grip fits M3 hex cap bolts and nuts. Specifications Socket Depth: 15.8mm Dimensions: 16.2cm x 2cm x 2cm (6.38in x 0.79in x 0.79in) Weight: 33g (1.16oz)', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1119/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/196/images/747/REV-41-1119-1__68915.1603466471.500.500.JPG?c=2', 'REV DUO / Hardware & Tools / Tools', 'rev'),
  ('M3 x 10mm Hex Cap Screws - 100 Pack', 'REV-41-1123-PK100', 'M3 Hex Cap Screws are compatible with the REV DUO System. Length measured from tip to underside of hex cap. Specifications Material: Corrosion Resistant Zinc Plated Steel Thread Pitch: M3 x 0.5 Head Dimensions: 5.5mm Hex Width, 2mm Height Length: Varies Based on Product Selection (see table below) Documentation DUO Build System Guide Tips & Tricks for Building with the DUO Build System Product Options SKU PRODUCT NAME CAD & DRAWINGS REV-41-1713-PK100 M3 x 6mm Hex Cap Screws - 100 Pack STEP…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/M3-Hex-Cap-Screws/?sku=REV-41-1123-PK100', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/722/images/2894/M3x10mm_Hex_Cap_Screws_Pack_Photo_From_Bundle_Shot__18790.1614451259.1280.1280__98672.1654289750.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('M3 x 20mm Hex Cap Screws - 100 Pack', 'REV-41-1124-PK100', 'M3 Hex Cap Screws are compatible with the REV DUO System. Length measured from tip to underside of hex cap. Specifications Material: Corrosion Resistant Zinc Plated Steel Thread Pitch: M3 x 0.5 Head Dimensions: 5.5mm Hex Width, 2mm Height Length: Varies Based on Product Selection (see table below) Documentation DUO Build System Guide Tips & Tricks for Building with the DUO Build System Product Options SKU PRODUCT NAME CAD & DRAWINGS REV-41-1713-PK100 M3 x 6mm Hex Cap Screws - 100 Pack STEP…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/M3-Hex-Cap-Screws/?sku=REV-41-1124-PK100', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/722/images/2894/M3x10mm_Hex_Cap_Screws_Pack_Photo_From_Bundle_Shot__18790.1614451259.1280.1280__98672.1654289750.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('M3 x 35mm Hex Cap Screws - 50 Pack', 'REV-41-1125-PK50', 'M3 Hex Cap Screws are compatible with the REV DUO System. Length measured from tip to underside of hex cap. Specifications Material: Corrosion Resistant Zinc Plated Steel Thread Pitch: M3 x 0.5 Head Dimensions: 5.5mm Hex Width, 2mm Height Length: Varies Based on Product Selection (see table below) Documentation DUO Build System Guide Tips & Tricks for Building with the DUO Build System Product Options SKU PRODUCT NAME CAD & DRAWINGS REV-41-1713-PK100 M3 x 6mm Hex Cap Screws - 100 Pack STEP…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/M3-Hex-Cap-Screws/?sku=REV-41-1125-PK50', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/722/images/2894/M3x10mm_Hex_Cap_Screws_Pack_Photo_From_Bundle_Shot__18790.1614451259.1280.1280__98672.1654289750.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('M3 Nut - 100 Pack', 'REV-41-1126-PK100', 'M3 Nyloc Nuts (REV-41-1361-PK100) are zinc plated steel nuts compatible with all REV M3 screws or bolts. Contains a nylon insert which increases grip on screw, reducing the chance of the nut loosening over time. Does NOT fit in the channel of our REV DUO 15mm Extrusion System. M3 Nuts (REV-41-1126-PK100) Zinc plated steel nuts compatible with all REV DUO M3 screws or bolts. This is a plain nut which does NOT contains a nylon insert. Specifications Thread Pitch: M3 x 0.5 Material: Corrosion…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/M3-Nuts/?sku=REV-41-1126-PK100', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/966/images/3808/REV-41-1126-1361_M3Nuts_FAMILY_FINAL__12437.1778681422.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All', 'rev'),
  ('High Strength Hex Hub - 2 Pack', 'REV-41-1147-PK2', 'Universal Hex Adapter (REV-41-1833) also available as an alternative. This part is a replacement for the discontinued Hex Hub Adapter (REV-41-1146). Expand your team''s building options without giving up the products that you already own. This sintered steel hub allows teams to use their existing wheels and gears with the improved reliability of a 5mm hex shaft. The High Strength Hex Hub has a number of new features which work better with the existing REV DUO product line as well as maintaining…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1147-pk2/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/217/images/802/REV-41-1147_High_Strength_Hex_Adapter2__41896.1615482340.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('60mm Omni Wheel - 2 Pack', 'REV-41-1160-PK2', 'DUO Omni Wheels are compatible with the REV DUO System and have rollers mounted around the outside which passively rotate at 90 degrees to the powered direction of the wheel. DUO Omni Wheels can be used to make it easier to turn with skid steer robots or can be used to make more advanced robot drive trains like kiwi drive. DUO Omni Wheels can be double stacked to create a continuous outside roller surface. Specifications Hub Material: Nylon (PA66) Roller Material: TPU Thickness: 15mm Hole…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/DUO-Omni-Wheels/?sku=REV-41-1160-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/721/images/2890/REV-41-0000-DUO-Omni-Wheels-Hero-FINAL__23968.1654286939.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('Zip Ties - Black - 160mm - 50 Pack', 'REV-41-1161-PK50', 'Nylon Zip Ties with rounded edges to prevent snagging. Length is idea for cable management and many other uses. Specifications 160mm long Quality nylon construction 18lb. tensile strength', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1161-pk50/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/232/images/820/Zipties_REV-41-1161_1__15802.1494520525.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('1.2mm UHMWPE Cord - 10M', 'REV-41-1162', '1.2mm UHMWPE Cord - 10M (REV-41-1162) is a high strength string for use with the small Pulley Bearings and the 15mm Linear Motion Kit to create a powered lift. 3mm UHMWPE Cord - 10m (REV-29-1244) is a high-strength and low-stretch cord that is ideal for actuating lifts and other linear mechanisms. Also known as Spectra or Dyneema, this cord type minimizes the need for adjustments and re-tensioning after first assembly due to its low-stretch properties. Specifications Material:…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/UHMWPE-Cords/?sku=REV-41-1162', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/968/images/3814/REV-41-1162-1244_UHMWPECords_FAMILY_FINAL__45422.1778771472.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / FTC Team Discount Program', 'rev'),
  ('Surgical Tubing - 3mm', 'REV-41-1163', 'This stretchy latex rubber tubing is sized to fit through any of the M3 holes in DUO brackets, wheels, gears or other motion products. String tubing between outside holes on two wheels to create a compliant intake. Specifications Color: Black Material: Rubber Latex Length: 3m Outer Diameter: 3mm Caution: This product contains natural rubber latex which may cause allergic reaction. In the event of a suspected allergic reaction, consult a medical professional immediately.', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1163/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/227/images/808/Surgical_Tubing_REV-41-1163-black_1__96733.1603466416.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('Polyurethane Round Belt - 6mm - 6ft', 'REV-41-1164', 'Our Polyurethane Hollow Round Belting is perfect for your conveyor, and intake mechanisms. Use Barbs to assemble custom length belts.', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1164/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/228/images/854/polycord__91088.1494520527.500.500.jpg?c=2', 'REV DUO / Motion / Gears, Chain, & Belts', 'rev'),
  ('Barb for Polyurethane Hollow Belt - 8 Pack', 'REV-41-1165-PK8', 'Use these barbs with our Polyurethane Hollow Belt to join the ends and make custom length belts quickly and easily. CAD & Drawings REV-41-1165 Drawing', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1165-pk8/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/229/images/2353/REV-41-1165-Photo5__96927.1654195209.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Motion / Gears, Chain, & Belts', 'rev'),
  ('Battery Holder Plate - 2 Pack', 'REV-41-1166-PK2', '12V Slim Battery Accessories help keep your REV 12V Slim Batteries securely mounted, charged, and ready to power your robot. This product family includes the Battery Holder Plate for mounting a REV 12V Battery, Control Hub, or Expansion Hub, as well as the Battery Charger for charging REV 12V Slim Batteries with an XT30 connection. The battery plate (REV-41-1166-PK2) is the perfect size to support a REV 12v Battery, REV Control Hub, or REV Expansion Hub. The battery charger for use with our…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/12V-Slim-Battery-Accessories/?sku=REV-41-1166-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/964/images/3803/REV-31-1299_BatteryAccessories_FAMILY_FINAL__46053.1778539185.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / Electronics / Power System', 'rev'),
  ('Replacement Gear Set for Smart Robot Servo', 'REV-41-1168', 'Complete gear set replacement for the Smart Robot Servo (REV-41-1097) Notes Replacement Gear Sets purchased after 03/27/2019 ship with updated versions of the replacement gears that fit the updated version of the Smart Robot Servo. If you have an older version of the Smart Robot Servo, purchased BEFORE 01/07/19, then these new replacement gear sets will not properly fit. Documentation Servo Gear Replacement Guide', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1168/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/215/images/1713/Servo_Gear_Replacemnt_Set_Original_Photo_Fixed_Up_By_Lauren__44535.1600983563.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Motion / Motors & Servos', 'rev'),
  ('90mm Omni Wheel - 2 Pack', 'REV-41-1190-PK2', 'DUO Omni Wheels are compatible with the REV DUO System and have rollers mounted around the outside which passively rotate at 90 degrees to the powered direction of the wheel. DUO Omni Wheels can be used to make it easier to turn with skid steer robots or can be used to make more advanced robot drive trains like kiwi drive. DUO Omni Wheels can be double stacked to create a continuous outside roller surface. Specifications Hub Material: Nylon (PA66) Roller Material: TPU Thickness: 15mm Hole…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/DUO-Omni-Wheels/?sku=REV-41-1190-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/721/images/2890/REV-41-0000-DUO-Omni-Wheels-Hero-FINAL__23968.1654286939.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('USB Retention Mount and Cable', 'REV-41-1214', 'Reduce the number of USB disconnects between the Expansion Hub and your Robot Controller Phone with our USB Retention Mount. When used with the included right-angle USB cable, this mount provides a strong, reliable connection between the cable and the hub. The mount consists of a base that remains attached to the hub, and a cap that screws into that base allowing for removal of the USB connector on your own terms. Fast and easy installation instructions are included with the kit. Kit Contents…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1214/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/343/images/2740/USB_Retention_Mount_Example__19448.1650563934.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('Storage Tote - Orange', 'REV-41-1215', 'Tote around your extra robot parts with the classic REV Storage Tote. This is the same tote included with the EDU Kit V2 and the FTC Starter Kit V3.1 as well as previous versions. Specifications Color: Orange External: Length: 554mm (21.81in) Width: 344.5mm (13.56in) Height: 210mm (8.25in) Internal: Length: 489mm (19.25in) Width: 305mm (12in) Height: 184mm (7.25in) Weight: 2110g (4.65lb)', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1215/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/537/images/1626/REV-41-1215_Storage_Tote-Orange__71967.1595267648.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Kits & Bundles', 'rev'),
  ('90mm Grip Wheel', 'REV-41-1267', 'DUO Grip Wheels are wider than our standard wheels, giving teams more traction while still being lightweight and robust. This wheel is compatible with 5mm hex shaft, which completely eliminates the need for expensive hubs or using potentially unreliable set screws. Specifications Diameter: 90mm Width: 25mm Hub Material: Nylon (PA66) Hub Bore: 5mm Hex Tread Material: TPU Tread Durometer: 65A Hole Diameter: M3 Clearance Hole Spacing: 8mm Weight (single wheel): 88g (3.10oz) Documentation DUO…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1267/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/344/images/1192/90mm_Grip_Wheel__30858.1533945208.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('HD Hex Motor No Gearbox', 'REV-41-1291', 'The HD Hex series motors and gearboxes feature integrated encoders and power that plug right into the Control Hub (REV-31-1595) and Expansion Hub (REV-31-1153). The gearbox options feature 5mm Hex output or coupler making it easy to connect gears, sprockets, wheels, etc. Encoder and power cables are included with motor. The HD Hex Motor is similar in size and power to other brushed 550 class motors with more convenient output options and connectors. The pinion that is installed on this motor…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/REV-41-1291/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/597/images/3613/HD_Hex_HERO_FINAL__95404.1761255494.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Motion / Motors & Servos', 'rev'),
  ('Core Hex Motor', 'REV-41-1300', 'The Core Hex Motor is compatible with the DUO Build System and features a 90 degree orientation and a female output shaft for maximum flexibility and ease of use. Insert any of the REV standard 5mm Hex Shafts into or through the Core Hex Motor to create custom length motor output shafts. The Core Hex Motor has a built in magnetic quadrature encoder which is compatible with 5V or 3.3V logic level devices including the Control Hub (REV-31-1595) and Expansion Hub (REV-31-1153). Specifications…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1300/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/195/images/2675/REV-41-1300_Core_Hex5_not_lm__05075.1661790332.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('HD Hex Motor 40:1 Spur Gearbox', 'REV-41-1301', 'The HD Hex series motors and gearboxes feature integrated encoders and power that plug right into the Control Hub (REV-31-1595) and Expansion Hub (REV-31-1153). The gearbox options feature 5mm Hex output or coupler making it easy to connect gears, sprockets, wheels, etc. Encoder and power cables are included with motor. The HD Hex Motor is similar in size and power to other brushed 550 class motors with more convenient output options and connectors. The HD Hex Motor 40:1 Spur Gearbox is…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1301/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/594/images/2931/Lone_HDHex-New_Sticker-noflag__98232.1659470612.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All / Discontinued & Discounted Products', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Plastic Motion Bracket - 8 Pack', 'REV-41-1303-PK8', '15mm Plastic Motion Brackets are compatible with the REV DUO System. Each bracket features a set of alignment ribs designed to seat the bracket into the extrusion channel increasing joint alignment, strength, and rigidity. The 15mm Plastic Motion Bracket (REV-41-1303), 15mm Plastic Rod End Bracket (REV-41-1304), and 15mm Gearbox Motion Bracket (REV-41-1315) can be used with REV DUO Plastic Bearings to support a shaft. The 15mm Plastic Indexable Motion Bracket (REV-41-1313) is used to create an…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-Plastic-Motion-Brackets/?sku=REV-41-1303-PK8', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/709/images/2897/REV-41-0000-15mmPlasticMotionBrackets-Hero-FINAL__74609.1654613121.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Plastic Rod End Bracket - 8 Pack', 'REV-41-1304-PK8', '15mm Plastic Motion Brackets are compatible with the REV DUO System. Each bracket features a set of alignment ribs designed to seat the bracket into the extrusion channel increasing joint alignment, strength, and rigidity. The 15mm Plastic Motion Bracket (REV-41-1303), 15mm Plastic Rod End Bracket (REV-41-1304), and 15mm Gearbox Motion Bracket (REV-41-1315) can be used with REV DUO Plastic Bearings to support a shaft. The 15mm Plastic Indexable Motion Bracket (REV-41-1313) is used to create an…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-Plastic-Motion-Brackets/?sku=REV-41-1304-PK8', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/709/images/2897/REV-41-0000-15mmPlasticMotionBrackets-Hero-FINAL__74609.1654613121.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Plastic 90 Degree Bracket - 8 Pack', 'REV-41-1305-PK8', '15mm Plastic Brackets are compatible with the REV DUO System. Each bracket includes a set of alignment ribs designed to seat the bracket into the extrusion channel increasing joint alignment, strength, and rigidity. The 15mm Plastic Variable Angle Bracket (REV-41-1318) has a larger arced channel allowing two pieces of extrusion to be adjusted to any angle. The smaller arced indentation is a drill alignment mark so once the angle is set, an additional bolt can be added to lock the bracket angle…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-Plastic-Brackets/?sku=REV-41-1305-PK8', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/708/images/2896/REV-41-0000-15mmPlasticBrackets-Hero-FINAL__04319.1654542861.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Plastic 60 Degree Bracket - 8 Pack', 'REV-41-1306-PK8', '15mm Plastic Brackets are compatible with the REV DUO System. Each bracket includes a set of alignment ribs designed to seat the bracket into the extrusion channel increasing joint alignment, strength, and rigidity. The 15mm Plastic Variable Angle Bracket (REV-41-1318) has a larger arced channel allowing two pieces of extrusion to be adjusted to any angle. The smaller arced indentation is a drill alignment mark so once the angle is set, an additional bolt can be added to lock the bracket angle…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-Plastic-Brackets/?sku=REV-41-1306-PK8', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/708/images/2896/REV-41-0000-15mmPlasticBrackets-Hero-FINAL__04319.1654542861.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Plastic 45 Degree Bracket - 8 Pack', 'REV-41-1307-PK8', '15mm Plastic Brackets are compatible with the REV DUO System. Each bracket includes a set of alignment ribs designed to seat the bracket into the extrusion channel increasing joint alignment, strength, and rigidity. The 15mm Plastic Variable Angle Bracket (REV-41-1318) has a larger arced channel allowing two pieces of extrusion to be adjusted to any angle. The smaller arced indentation is a drill alignment mark so once the angle is set, an additional bolt can be added to lock the bracket angle…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-Plastic-Brackets/?sku=REV-41-1307-PK8', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/708/images/2896/REV-41-0000-15mmPlasticBrackets-Hero-FINAL__04319.1654542861.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Plastic 30 Degree Bracket - 8 Pack', 'REV-41-1308-PK8', '15mm Plastic Brackets are compatible with the REV DUO System. Each bracket includes a set of alignment ribs designed to seat the bracket into the extrusion channel increasing joint alignment, strength, and rigidity. The 15mm Plastic Variable Angle Bracket (REV-41-1318) has a larger arced channel allowing two pieces of extrusion to be adjusted to any angle. The smaller arced indentation is a drill alignment mark so once the angle is set, an additional bolt can be added to lock the bracket angle…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-Plastic-Brackets/?sku=REV-41-1308-PK8', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/708/images/2896/REV-41-0000-15mmPlasticBrackets-Hero-FINAL__04319.1654542861.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Plastic 135 Degree Bracket - 8 Pack', 'REV-41-1310-PK8', '15mm Plastic Brackets are compatible with the REV DUO System. Each bracket includes a set of alignment ribs designed to seat the bracket into the extrusion channel increasing joint alignment, strength, and rigidity. The 15mm Plastic Variable Angle Bracket (REV-41-1318) has a larger arced channel allowing two pieces of extrusion to be adjusted to any angle. The smaller arced indentation is a drill alignment mark so once the angle is set, an additional bolt can be added to lock the bracket angle…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-Plastic-Brackets/?sku=REV-41-1310-PK8', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/708/images/2896/REV-41-0000-15mmPlasticBrackets-Hero-FINAL__04319.1654542861.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Plastic 120 Degree Bracket - 6 Pack', 'REV-41-1311-PK6', '15mm Plastic Brackets are compatible with the REV DUO System. Each bracket includes a set of alignment ribs designed to seat the bracket into the extrusion channel increasing joint alignment, strength, and rigidity. The 15mm Plastic Variable Angle Bracket (REV-41-1318) has a larger arced channel allowing two pieces of extrusion to be adjusted to any angle. The smaller arced indentation is a drill alignment mark so once the angle is set, an additional bolt can be added to lock the bracket angle…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-Plastic-Brackets/?sku=REV-41-1311-PK6', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/708/images/2896/REV-41-0000-15mmPlasticBrackets-Hero-FINAL__04319.1654542861.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
