  ('15mm Gearbox Motion Bracket - 4 Pack', 'REV-41-1315-PK4', '15mm Plastic Motion Brackets are compatible with the REV DUO System. Each bracket features a set of alignment ribs designed to seat the bracket into the extrusion channel increasing joint alignment, strength, and rigidity. The 15mm Plastic Motion Bracket (REV-41-1303), 15mm Plastic Rod End Bracket (REV-41-1304), and 15mm Gearbox Motion Bracket (REV-41-1315) can be used with REV DUO Plastic Bearings to support a shaft. The 15mm Plastic Indexable Motion Bracket (REV-41-1313) is used to create an…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-Plastic-Motion-Brackets/?sku=REV-41-1315-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/709/images/2897/REV-41-0000-15mmPlasticMotionBrackets-Hero-FINAL__74609.1654613121.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('- 15mm Hex Pillow Block - 4 Pack', 'REV-41-1316-PK4', 'This bearing pillow block bracket (REV-41-1317) is used with the DUO Build System 15mm Extrusion. The 9mm center hole is use with either the Long Through-bore Bearing (REV-41-1329) or the End Cap Bearing (REV-41-1322) to provide a low friction shaft support. This bracket has alignment ribs on the bottom which help align the bracket with the extrusion channel. This bearing pillow block bracket (REV-41-1316) is used with the DUO Build System 15mm Extrusion. The hex center hole fits the 5mm hex…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-Pillow-Blocks/?sku=REV-41-1316-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/900/images/3585/15mmPillowBlocks_FAMILY_FINAL__66342.1760541910.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('- 15mm Bearing Pillow Block - 8 Pack', 'REV-41-1317-PK8', 'This bearing pillow block bracket (REV-41-1317) is used with the DUO Build System 15mm Extrusion. The 9mm center hole is use with either the Long Through-bore Bearing (REV-41-1329) or the End Cap Bearing (REV-41-1322) to provide a low friction shaft support. This bracket has alignment ribs on the bottom which help align the bracket with the extrusion channel. This bearing pillow block bracket (REV-41-1316) is used with the DUO Build System 15mm Extrusion. The hex center hole fits the 5mm hex…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-Pillow-Blocks/?sku=REV-41-1317-PK8', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/900/images/3585/15mmPillowBlocks_FAMILY_FINAL__66342.1760541910.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Plastic Variable Angle Bracket - 4 Pack', 'REV-41-1318-PK4', '15mm Plastic Brackets are compatible with the REV DUO System. Each bracket includes a set of alignment ribs designed to seat the bracket into the extrusion channel increasing joint alignment, strength, and rigidity. The 15mm Plastic Variable Angle Bracket (REV-41-1318) has a larger arced channel allowing two pieces of extrusion to be adjusted to any angle. The smaller arced indentation is a drill alignment mark so once the angle is set, an additional bolt can be added to lock the bracket angle…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-Plastic-Brackets/?sku=REV-41-1318-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/708/images/2896/REV-41-0000-15mmPlasticBrackets-Hero-FINAL__04319.1654542861.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Plastic Servo Bracket - 2 Pack', 'REV-41-1319-PK2', '15mm Plastic Motion Brackets are compatible with the REV DUO System. Each bracket features a set of alignment ribs designed to seat the bracket into the extrusion channel increasing joint alignment, strength, and rigidity. The 15mm Plastic Motion Bracket (REV-41-1303), 15mm Plastic Rod End Bracket (REV-41-1304), and 15mm Gearbox Motion Bracket (REV-41-1315) can be used with REV DUO Plastic Bearings to support a shaft. The 15mm Plastic Indexable Motion Bracket (REV-41-1313) is used to create an…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-Plastic-Motion-Brackets/?sku=REV-41-1319-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/709/images/2897/REV-41-0000-15mmPlasticMotionBrackets-Hero-FINAL__74609.1654613121.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Plastic Inside Corner Bracket - 8 Pack', 'REV-41-1320-PK8', 'This 90 degree inside corner bracket (REV-41-1320-PK8) is used with the DUO Build System 15mm Extrusion. These plastic brackets have webbing to strengthen the corner and includes a set of alignment ribs designed to seat the bracket into the extrusion channel increasing joint alignment, strength, and rigidity. This lap corner bracket (REV-41-1321-PK8) is used with the DUO Build System 15mm Extrusion. These plastic brackets have webbing to strengthen the corner and includes a set of alignment…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-corner-brackets/?sku=REV-41-1320-PK8', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/902/images/3566/15mm_Corner_Brackets_Family__38336.1758909388.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / Structure / Brackets', 'rev'),
  ('15mm Plastic Lap Corner Bracket - 8 Pack', 'REV-41-1321-PK8', 'This 90 degree inside corner bracket (REV-41-1320-PK8) is used with the DUO Build System 15mm Extrusion. These plastic brackets have webbing to strengthen the corner and includes a set of alignment ribs designed to seat the bracket into the extrusion channel increasing joint alignment, strength, and rigidity. This lap corner bracket (REV-41-1321-PK8) is used with the DUO Build System 15mm Extrusion. These plastic brackets have webbing to strengthen the corner and includes a set of alignment…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/15mm-corner-brackets/?sku=REV-41-1321-PK8', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/902/images/3566/15mm_Corner_Brackets_Family__38336.1758909388.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / Structure / Brackets', 'rev'),
  ('End Cap Bearing - 8 Pack', 'REV-41-1322-PK8', 'The End Cap Bearing is used with the 5mm hex shaft recommended for the DUO Build System 15mm Extrusion to provide a low friction rotating shaft support. This bearing is intended to seat in any of the plastic REV DUO brackets with the 9mm ID bearing seat including: REV-41-1313, REV-41-1303 and REV-41-1304. The bearing has a larger diameter flange that helps retain the shaft and bearing against the bracket. Specifications Material: Acetal (Delrin/POM) Bearing Surface OD: 9mm Bearing Surface…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1322-pk8/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/166/images/2495/REV-41-1322-bigcommerce-edit__58291.1640724044.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Motion / Bearings, Shafts, & Spacers', 'rev'),
  ('5mm Hex Shaft Spacer - 15mm - 12 Pack', 'REV-41-1323-PK12', '5mm Hex Spacers are compatible with the REV DUO System and accurate way to space gears, sprockets, wheels, and other parts along a 5mm hex shaft. Mix and match various spacer lengths to adjust spacing in increments as small as 1.5mm. Specifications Material: Acetal (Delrin/POM) Length: Varies Based on Product Selection (see table below) OD: 8mm ID: 5mm Hex Documentation DUO Build System Guide Product Options SKU PRODUCT NAME CAD & DRAWINGS REV-41-1325-PK28 5mm Hex Shaft Spacer - 1.5mm - 28…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/5mm-Hex-Spacers/?sku=REV-41-1323-PK12', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/717/images/2904/REV-41-0000-5mmHexSpacers-Hero-FINAL__66146.1654620358.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('5mm Hex Shaft Spacer - 3mm - 16 Pack', 'REV-41-1324-PK16', '5mm Hex Spacers are compatible with the REV DUO System and accurate way to space gears, sprockets, wheels, and other parts along a 5mm hex shaft. Mix and match various spacer lengths to adjust spacing in increments as small as 1.5mm. Specifications Material: Acetal (Delrin/POM) Length: Varies Based on Product Selection (see table below) OD: 8mm ID: 5mm Hex Documentation DUO Build System Guide Product Options SKU PRODUCT NAME CAD & DRAWINGS REV-41-1325-PK28 5mm Hex Shaft Spacer - 1.5mm - 28…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/5mm-Hex-Spacers/?sku=REV-41-1324-PK16', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/717/images/2904/REV-41-0000-5mmHexSpacers-Hero-FINAL__66146.1654620358.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('5mm Hex Shaft Spacer - 1.5mm - 28 Pack', 'REV-41-1325-PK28', '5mm Hex Spacers are compatible with the REV DUO System and accurate way to space gears, sprockets, wheels, and other parts along a 5mm hex shaft. Mix and match various spacer lengths to adjust spacing in increments as small as 1.5mm. Specifications Material: Acetal (Delrin/POM) Length: Varies Based on Product Selection (see table below) OD: 8mm ID: 5mm Hex Documentation DUO Build System Guide Product Options SKU PRODUCT NAME CAD & DRAWINGS REV-41-1325-PK28 5mm Hex Shaft Spacer - 1.5mm - 28…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/5mm-Hex-Spacers/?sku=REV-41-1325-PK28', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/717/images/2904/REV-41-0000-5mmHexSpacers-Hero-FINAL__66146.1654620358.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('Through Bore Bearing - Short - 12 Pack', 'REV-41-1326-PK12', 'Through Bore Bearings are compatible with the REV DUO System and are used with 5mm Hex Shafts recommend for the DUO Extrusion System to provide a low friction rotating shaft support. These low profile bearings fit in any of the 3mm thick brackets with a the 9mm ID bearing seat including: REV-41-1313, REV-41-1303 and REV-41-1304. Use shaft collars to secure the shaft and the bearings. Specifications Material: Acetal (Delrin/POM) Bearing Surface OD: 9mm ID: 5mm Hex Bearing Surface Width: 3mm…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/Through-Bore-Bearings/?sku=REV-41-1326-PK12', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/718/images/2906/REV-41-0000-ThroughBoreBearing-Hero-FINAL__95714.1654628521.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('Shaft Collars - 10 Pack', 'REV-41-1327-PK10', 'The shaft collar (REV-41-1327) is compatible with the DUO Build System and is used to prevent gears, sprockets, wheels, and other parts from sliding out of place on a 5mm hex shaft. Shaft collars can also be used to prevent the shaft itself from sliding out of its mounts. Once in place, the set screw is tightened on one(15) of the flat sides of the hex shaft. 1.5mm Allen Wrench for use with set screws sold separately. The REV Robotics Slim Shaft Collar (REV-41-1629) is used to prevent gears,…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/shaft-collars?sku=REV-41-1327-PK10', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/977/images/3883/REV-41-1327-1629_ShaftCollarFamily_FINAL_v1__46328.1791304665.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All', 'rev'),
  ('Servo Shaft Adapter - 4 Pack', 'REV-41-1328-PK4', 'The Servo Shaft Adapter makes it possible to drive a 5mm hex shaft with any 25T output servo including the Smart Robot Servo. The adapter attaches to the servo spline like any common servo horn and accepts a 5mm hex shaft on the opposite end. Specifications Material: Acetal (Delrin/POM) Servo Spline Type: 25T ID: 5mm hex Inside Hex Depth: 12mm Documentation DUO Build System Guide CAD & Drawings REV-41-1328 STEP File REV-41-1328 Onshape REV-41-1328 Drawing', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-41-1328-pk4/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/171/images/2380/REV-41-1328-Servo-Shaft-Adapters-AliciaFINAL__94334.1714743859.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('Through Bore Bearing - Long - 12 Pack', 'REV-41-1329-PK12', 'Through Bore Bearings are compatible with the REV DUO System and are used with 5mm Hex Shafts recommend for the DUO Extrusion System to provide a low friction rotating shaft support. These low profile bearings fit in any of the 3mm thick brackets with a the 9mm ID bearing seat including: REV-41-1313, REV-41-1303 and REV-41-1304. Use shaft collars to secure the shaft and the bearings. Specifications Material: Acetal (Delrin/POM) Bearing Surface OD: 9mm ID: 5mm Hex Bearing Surface Width: 3mm…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/Through-Bore-Bearings/?sku=REV-41-1329-PK12', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/718/images/2906/REV-41-0000-ThroughBoreBearing-Hero-FINAL__95714.1654628521.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('15 Tooth Plastic Gear - 8 Pack', 'REV-41-1331-PK8', '5mm Plastic Hex Bore Gears are compatible with the REV DUO System and fit on a 5mm hex shaft. The hex shaft interface completely eliminates the need for expensive hubs or using potentially unreliable set screws. Gears 45 tooth and larger have a hole pattern on an 8mm pitch enabling easy mounting directly to DUO Extrusion, DUO Brackets, and other 8mm pitch systems. All DUO motion products have a uniform 15mm width to make quick design swaps fast and easy. Warning: Gears from other building…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/5mm-Plastic-Hex-Bore-Gears/?sku=REV-41-1331-PK8', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/714/images/2902/REV-41-0000-PlasticGears-HEro-FINAL__71233.1654613518.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / REV DUO FTC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
